010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.161.170.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79879,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, Yesterday, 10:29 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1453573799,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e619826c330fea062e90af0258a1e810","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the boards AmandaU and congrats on your dw!!! Both venues you&#039;re considering have lots of picturesque spots for backdrops to your wedding photos.....as you can see here in the magical wedding moments that matter we captured there....enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152285887359487.1073741881.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;NOW Sapphire Wedding Story Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/1836812_10152285889209487_294479734_o.jpg\" alt=\"1836812_10152285889209487_294479734_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/t31.0-8\/10010300_10152285889709487_764706269_o.jpg\" alt=\"10010300_10152285889709487_764706269_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash2\/t31.0-8\/1658491_10152285891094487_621077093_o.jpg\" alt=\"1658491_10152285891094487_621077093_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash2\/t31.0-8\/1798918_10152285894759487_1160561147_o.jpg\" alt=\"1798918_10152285894759487_1160561147_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152498670514487.1073741900.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Excellence Riviera Cancun&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/10494940_10152498672349487_7678961110157199349_o.jpg\" alt=\"10494940_10152498672349487_7678961110157\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/10481558_10152498675414487_3399070410916644449_o.jpg\" alt=\"10481558_10152498675414487_3399070410916\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/10382052_10152498675634487_6244806697421953761_o.jpg\" alt=\"10382052_10152498675634487_6244806697421\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10453012_10152498677914487_2192352328609361964_o.jpg\" alt=\"10453012_10152498677914487_2192352328609\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and that you find the best answers for your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909932,"PostDate":1453573628,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the boards AmandaU and congrats on your dw!!! Both venues you're considering have lots of picturesque spots for backdrops to your wedding photos.....as you can see here in the magical wedding moments that matter we captured there....enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....from the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152285887359487.1073741881.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>NOW Sapphire Wedding Story Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/1836812_10152285889209487_294479734_o.jpg\" alt=\"1836812_10152285889209487_294479734_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/t31.0-8\/10010300_10152285889709487_764706269_o.jpg\" alt=\"10010300_10152285889709487_764706269_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash2\/t31.0-8\/1658491_10152285891094487_621077093_o.jpg\" alt=\"1658491_10152285891094487_621077093_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash2\/t31.0-8\/1798918_10152285894759487_1160561147_o.jpg\" alt=\"1798918_10152285894759487_1160561147_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...from the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152498670514487.1073741900.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Excellence Riviera Cancun<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/10494940_10152498672349487_7678961110157199349_o.jpg\" alt=\"10494940_10152498672349487_7678961110157\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/10481558_10152498675414487_3399070410916644449_o.jpg\" alt=\"10481558_10152498675414487_3399070410916\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-frc3\/t31.0-8\/10382052_10152498675634487_6244806697421953761_o.jpg\" alt=\"10382052_10152498675634487_6244806697421\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10453012_10152498677914487_2192352328609361964_o.jpg\" alt=\"10453012_10152498677914487_2192352328609\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and that you find the best answers for your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.41.78","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79879,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"10a77e169fba4a9afb65304934361ff2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@AmandaU&amp;nbsp; Congrats and welcome! You&#039;ve picked two beautiful resorts! Both are fairly popular here so if you&#039;re looking for info, it should be easy to find by searching in the search bar up top.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909979,"PostDate":1453676686,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@AmandaU\u00a0 Congrats and welcome! You've picked two beautiful resorts! Both are fairly popular here so if you're looking for info, it should be easy to find by searching in the search bar up top.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79879","Title":"Newb - Nov 16, 2016 @ Now Sapphire","LastPostDate":1453676686},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
