Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4591a5b66c22dd265b0a4605a7e867a","RawContent":"Were only doing a symbolic ceremony. The idea of getting my blood drawn some where else kinda skeeves me out. Were getting married in NJ a week before we leave and telling very few people about it. In fact It has given me an opportunity to incorporate a bridesmaid who is unable to attend into the wedding because she will be the witness for our ceremony in NJ. \n \n All I know about there photography is that it is a contracted company which Nayeli didn&#8217;t give me the name of. She did however say they have a booth in the main lobby, which I didn&#8217;t see during the sight visit. Luckily, for me my dad is a photographer and my bother is a video-grapher and I plan on using both of there services for my wedding and my ttd pictures. I know my dad can&#8217;t walk me down the aisle and take pictures so that&#8217;s what im using their photographer for. After im down the aisle it&#8217;s back to work for dad. \n \n If you looking for a particular type of photo as in more photo journalistic I would suggest you look for an outside photographer. If you want more posed photos then stick with the one who is at the resort.","Attachments":[],"Id":535121,"PostDate":1229449090,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Were only doing a symbolic ceremony. The idea of getting my blood drawn some where else kinda skeeves me out. Were getting married in NJ a week before we leave and telling very few people about it. In fact It has given me an opportunity to incorporate a bridesmaid who is unable to attend into the wedding because she will be the witness for our ceremony in NJ. <br \/> <br \/> All I know about there photography is that it is a contracted company which Nayeli didn&#8217;t give me the name of. She did however say they have a booth in the main lobby, which I didn&#8217;t see during the sight visit. Luckily, for me my dad is a photographer and my bother is a video-grapher and I plan on using both of there services for my wedding and my ttd pictures. I know my dad can&#8217;t walk me down the aisle and take pictures so that&#8217;s what im using their photographer for. After im down the aisle it&#8217;s back to work for dad. <br \/> <br \/> If you looking for a particular type of photo as in more photo journalistic I would suggest you look for an outside photographer. If you want more posed photos then stick with the one who is at the resort.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7e5b606f87603dcf56b20accdf4f0859","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;mrsgns2b&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;We finally have a date, April 13, 2009 at 5:00. We&#039;re trying to decide whether we do the legal ceremony here or there. What is everyone doing? Their legal requirements seem like a lot of work...\n \n Oh! Does anyone have any info on their photography? I think I want to look for an outside one but I haven&#039;t seen their &amp;quot;in-house&amp;quot; photographer. TIA&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n We&#039;re having a legal ceremony. The legal requirements do seem like a lot of work, but I have found it not to be as hard as it seems like it would be.\n \n I am cutting and pasting an email I received from Nayeli about the EPM photographer and packages offered. We chose to go with Cecilia Dumas for our pictures rather than the in-house studio. We liked her work better but this studio looks pretty decent by the pictures on their website.\n \n Como estas?\n Thank you so much for your comments, I really love my job and I try to do my best in every wedding.\n I do not remember which photographer did I mention to you because we are working with another one and his packages are a little bit different, his webpage is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.corphoto.com.mx\"&gt;Weddings By Corpho&lt;\/a&gt; his packages are below and he has a lot of experience in weddings on the beach.\n \n In case that you want to hire an outside photographer, you only need to pay for her day pass $100 usd.\n \n Jennifer, have an excellent day!\n \n PACKAGE \u00e2\u20ac\u0153A\u00e2\u20ac\u009d \n 24 Color photos on a CD $210 usd\n 36 Color photos on a CD $250 usd\n Photo album and prints are not included\n \n PACKAGE \u00e2\u20ac\u0153B\u00e2\u20ac\u009d \n 24 Photos printed in 4\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $250 usd\n 24 Photos printed in 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $280 usd\n 24 Photos printed in 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $320 usd\n These packages included CD with the 24 pictures of your selection and album\n \n PACKAGE \u00e2\u20ac\u0153C\u00e2\u20ac\u009d \n 36 Photos printed in 4\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $340 usd\n 36 Photos printed in 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $380 usd\n 36 Photos printed in 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $415 usd\n These packages included CD with the 36 pictures of your selection and album\n \n PACKAGE \u00e2\u20ac\u0153D\u00e2\u20ac\u009d\n 62 Photos printed in 4\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $580 usd\n 62 Photos printed in 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $615 usd\n 62 Photos printed in 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $650 usd\n These packages included CD with the 62 pictures of your selection and album\n \n \n *These packages include pictures during the ceremony, family and groom &amp;amp; bride session.\n (1 hour and 30 minutes of service).\n *We take double the photos indicated at every package \n * Extra photos available separately on CD $ 6.00 usd 4\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $8 usd; 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $9 usd; \n 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $10 usd; 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 10\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $15usd 11\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 14\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $20usd. \n *Shipping is not included at any package. You may pay $40 usd in case of early check out.\n \n \n PACKAGE \u00e2\u20ac\u0153BASiC\u00e2\u20ac\u009d\n 100 Photos printed in 4\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $960 usd\n 100 Photos printed in 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $1,0250 usd\n 100 Photos printed in 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $1,080 usd\n Include all the images on DVD + five 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 10\u00e2\u20ac\u009d + album + 2 hrs reception\n \n PACKAGE \u00e2\u20ac\u0153SUPERIOR\u00e2\u20ac\u009d \n 100 Color photos + 24 photos b&amp;amp;w printed in 4\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size $1,260 usd\n 100 Color photos + 24 photos b&amp;amp;w printed in 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size $1,320 usd\n 100 Color photos + 24 photos b&amp;amp;w printed in 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size $1,380 usd\n Include all the images on DVD + five 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 10\u00e2\u20ac\u009d + album + 2 hrs reception\n \n PACKAGE \u00e2\u20ac\u0153DELUXE\u00e2\u20ac\u009d\n 150 Color photos + 36 photos b&amp;amp;w printed in 4\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size $1,860 usd\n 150 Color photos + 36 photos b&amp;amp;w printed in 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size $2,040 usd\n 150 Color photos + 36 photos b&amp;amp;w printed in 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size $2,160 usd\n Include all the images on DVD + five 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 10\u00e2\u20ac\u009d + one 11\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 14\u00e2\u20ac\u009d + one 12\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 18\u00e2\u20ac\u009d \n + album + 3 hrs. reception\n \n *Service available to begin at the bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s room. 45 minutes befote the wedding\n *These package include pictures during the bride&#039;s room, ceremony, family, frends, groom &amp;amp; Bride\n Session and hrs. reception.\n *We take double the photos indicated at every package\n * Extra photos available separately 4\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $8 usd; 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $9 usd; 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $10 usd; 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 10\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $15usd\n 11\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 14\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $20usd \n *Additional time fee is $100usd every extra hour.\n *Estimated shipping time 2 weeks\n *Shipping included in these packages","Attachments":[],"Id":535404,"PostDate":1229467502,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>mrsgns2b<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">We finally have a date, April 13, 2009 at 5:00. We're trying to decide whether we do the legal ceremony here or there. What is everyone doing? Their legal requirements seem like a lot of work...<br \/> <br \/> Oh! Does anyone have any info on their photography? I think I want to look for an outside one but I haven't seen their \"in-house\" photographer. TIA<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> We're having a legal ceremony. The legal requirements do seem like a lot of work, but I have found it not to be as hard as it seems like it would be.<br \/> <br \/> I am cutting and pasting an email I received from Nayeli about the EPM photographer and packages offered. We chose to go with Cecilia Dumas for our pictures rather than the in-house studio. We liked her work better but this studio looks pretty decent by the pictures on their website.<br \/> <br \/> Como estas?<br \/> Thank you so much for your comments, I really love my job and I try to do my best in every wedding.<br \/> I do not remember which photographer did I mention to you because we are working with another one and his packages are a little bit different, his webpage is <a href='http:\/\/www.corphoto.com.mx' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Weddings By Corpho<\/a> his packages are below and he has a lot of experience in weddings on the beach.<br \/> <br \/> In case that you want to hire an outside photographer, you only need to pay for her day pass $100 usd.<br \/> <br \/> Jennifer, have an excellent day!<br \/> <br \/> PACKAGE \u00e2\u20ac\u0153A\u00e2\u20ac\u009d <br \/> 24 Color photos on a CD $210 usd<br \/> 36 Color photos on a CD $250 usd<br \/> Photo album and prints are not included<br \/> <br \/> PACKAGE \u00e2\u20ac\u0153B\u00e2\u20ac\u009d <br \/> 24 Photos printed in 4\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $250 usd<br \/> 24 Photos printed in 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $280 usd<br \/> 24 Photos printed in 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $320 usd<br \/> These packages included CD with the 24 pictures of your selection and album<br \/> <br \/> PACKAGE \u00e2\u20ac\u0153C\u00e2\u20ac\u009d <br \/> 36 Photos printed in 4\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $340 usd<br \/> 36 Photos printed in 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $380 usd<br \/> 36 Photos printed in 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $415 usd<br \/> These packages included CD with the 36 pictures of your selection and album<br \/> <br \/> PACKAGE \u00e2\u20ac\u0153D\u00e2\u20ac\u009d<br \/> 62 Photos printed in 4\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $580 usd<br \/> 62 Photos printed in 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $615 usd<br \/> 62 Photos printed in 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $650 usd<br \/> These packages included CD with the 62 pictures of your selection and album<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> *These packages include pictures during the ceremony, family and groom & bride session.<br \/> (1 hour and 30 minutes of service).<br \/> *We take double the photos indicated at every package <br \/> * Extra photos available separately on CD $ 6.00 usd 4\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $8 usd; 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $9 usd; <br \/> 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $10 usd; 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 10\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $15usd 11\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 14\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $20usd. <br \/> *Shipping is not included at any package. You may pay $40 usd in case of early check out.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> PACKAGE \u00e2\u20ac\u0153BASiC\u00e2\u20ac\u009d<br \/> 100 Photos printed in 4\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $960 usd<br \/> 100 Photos printed in 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $1,0250 usd<br \/> 100 Photos printed in 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size in color $1,080 usd<br \/> Include all the images on DVD + five 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 10\u00e2\u20ac\u009d + album + 2 hrs reception<br \/> <br \/> PACKAGE \u00e2\u20ac\u0153SUPERIOR\u00e2\u20ac\u009d <br \/> 100 Color photos + 24 photos b&w printed in 4\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size $1,260 usd<br \/> 100 Color photos + 24 photos b&w printed in 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size $1,320 usd<br \/> 100 Color photos + 24 photos b&w printed in 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size $1,380 usd<br \/> Include all the images on DVD + five 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 10\u00e2\u20ac\u009d + album + 2 hrs reception<br \/> <br \/> PACKAGE \u00e2\u20ac\u0153DELUXE\u00e2\u20ac\u009d<br \/> 150 Color photos + 36 photos b&w printed in 4\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size $1,860 usd<br \/> 150 Color photos + 36 photos b&w printed in 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size $2,040 usd<br \/> 150 Color photos + 36 photos b&w printed in 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d size $2,160 usd<br \/> Include all the images on DVD + five 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 10\u00e2\u20ac\u009d + one 11\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 14\u00e2\u20ac\u009d + one 12\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 18\u00e2\u20ac\u009d <br \/> + album + 3 hrs. reception<br \/> <br \/> *Service available to begin at the bride\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s room. 45 minutes befote the wedding<br \/> *These package include pictures during the bride's room, ceremony, family, frends, groom & Bride<br \/> Session and hrs. reception.<br \/> *We take double the photos indicated at every package<br \/> * Extra photos available separately 4\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $8 usd; 5\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 7\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $9 usd; 6\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $10 usd; 8\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 10\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $15usd<br \/> 11\u00e2\u20ac\u009d x 14\u00e2\u20ac\u009d $20usd <br \/> *Additional time fee is $100usd every extra hour.<br \/> *Estimated shipping time 2 weeks<br \/> *Shipping included in these packages\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c336\/dmbstolio\/Dec122009238-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c3...22009238-1.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jenandken2009.com\">www.jenandken2009.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20091212\/e\/Jen+%26amp%3B+Kenny%27s+wedding\/k\/02c3\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...02c3\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"davis1974@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1215061237,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210302.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":98,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jennifer Davis","Id":210302,"Name":"Jennifer Davis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53de5d58e679f2e51d3c4b5936d49ed0","RawContent":"Is the wedding by corpho link the photographer at excellence?","Attachments":[],"Id":535865,"PostDate":1229489037,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Is the wedding by corpho link the photographer at excellence?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"Formatted