a725786","RawContent":"Question: What wedding package are you using at Excellence. Im not particular fond of many of the food choices between the silver or gold package. I&#039;m currently taking the gold package but I was wonderin what everyone else is considering? \n \n Lauren","Attachments":[],"Id":554203,"PostDate":1231470714,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Question: What wedding package are you using at Excellence. Im not particular fond of many of the food choices between the silver or gold package. I'm currently taking the gold package but I was wonderin what everyone else is considering? <br \/> <br \/> Lauren\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","