{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db511bfd3124ac7ca39a34c029011dba","RawContent":"We chose the gold package too.\n \n I had issues with the menu selections because I have quite a few picky eaters in my group - some won&#039;t eat fish, two are vegetarians that only eat fish and one is a complete vegan. When I explained this to Nayeli, she advised that substitutions could be made on the menu. She also said we could give guests two options from the menu but that they would have to know ahead of time how many of each meal they would be making.\n \n My plan is to choose one fish and one chicken dish and ask guests to choose on the RSVP card which dish they would like. I will have one dish off the vegetarian menu for the vegan.\n \n Hope this helps =)","Attachments":[],"Id":556271,"PostDate":1231633634,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We chose the gold package too.<br \/> <br \/> I had issues with the menu selections because I have quite a few picky eaters in my group - some won't eat fish, two are vegetarians that only eat fish and one is a complete vegan. When I explained this to Nayeli, she advised that substitutions could be made on the menu. She also said we could give guests two options from the menu but that they would have to know ahead of time how many of 