{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"68f0c4d1fa9416c3c39da2f4ddad7b29","RawContent":"Normally, they used a closed resturant for the cocktail hour and reception. Below is the schedule and hours of the resturants. I know that it is popular to have cocktails at X-lounge on the beach. I dont know much about having a reception on the beach or outdoors by the pool. But, many of the resturants have outdoor areas If you would like to be outside. I&#039;m having my reception at Chez Isabelles, with cocktails on the outside veranda just off the resturant. Hope this helps! \n \n Lauren \n \n BARCELONA:\n Breakfast buffet from 7:00 to 11:00 am (opens daily)\n Lunch buffet from 12:00 to 4:30 pm (opens daily)\n Dinner a la Carte from 6:00 to 10:30 pm, it&#039;s closed on Mondays and Saturdays\n \n TOSCANA:\n Dinner a la Carte from 06:00 to 10:30 pm, it&#039;s closed on Tuesdays\n \n THE FLAVOR MARKET:\n Dinner a la Carte from 6:00 pm to 12:00 am, it&#039;s closed on Thursdays\n \n SPICE:\n Dinner a la Carte from 6:00 pm to 10:30 pm, it&#039;s closed on Sundays\n \n CHEZ ISABELLE\n Dinner a la Carte from 6:00 to 10:30 pm, it&#039;s closed on Wednesdays\n \n THE LOBSTER HOUSE:\n Breakfast a la Carte from 10:00 am to 12:00 pm (opens daily)\n Lunch a la Carte from 12:30 to 3:00 pm (opens daily)\n Dinner a la Carte from 6:30 to 11:00 pm, it&#039;s closed on Mondays and Fridays\n \n THE GRILL:\n Lunch a la Carte from 12:00 to 6:00 pm (opens daily)\n Dinner a la Carte from 6:30 to 11:00 pm, it&#039;s closed on Mondays and Fridays\n \n AGAVE:\n Dinner a la Carte from 6:00 pm to 10:30 pm, it&#039;s closed on Fridays","Attachments":[],"Id":583859,"PostDate":1233886214,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Normally, they used a closed resturant for the cocktail hour and reception. Below is the schedule and hours of the resturants. I know that it is popular to have cocktails at X-lounge on the beach. I dont know much about having a reception on the beach or outdoors by the pool. But, many of the resturants have outdoor areas If you would like to be outside. I'm having my reception at Chez Isabelles, with cocktails on the outside veranda just off the resturant. Hope this helps! <br \/> <br \/> Lauren <br \/> <br \/> BARCELONA:<br \/> Breakfast buffet from 7:00 to 11:00 am (opens daily)<br \/> Lunch buffet from 12:00 to 4:30 pm (opens daily)<br \/> Dinner a la Carte from 6:00 to 10:30 pm, it's closed on Mondays and Saturdays<br \/> <br \/> TOSCANA:<br \/> Dinner a la Carte from 06:00 to 10:30 pm, it's closed on Tuesdays<br \/> <br \/> THE FLAVOR MARKET:<br \/> Dinner a la Carte from 6:00 pm to 12:00 am, it's closed on Thursdays<br \/> <br \/> SPICE:<br \/> Dinner a la Carte from 6:00 pm to 10:30 pm, it's closed on Sundays<br \/> <br \/> CHEZ ISABELLE<br \/> Dinner a la Carte from 6:00 to 10:30 pm, it's closed on Wednesdays<br \/> <br \/> THE LOBSTER HOUSE:<br \/> Breakfast a la Carte from 10:00 am to 12:00 pm (opens daily)<br \/> Lunch a la Carte from 12:30 to 3:00 pm (opens daily)<br \/> Dinner a la Carte from 6:30 to 11:00 pm, it's closed on Mondays and Fridays<br \/> <br \/> THE GRILL:<br \/> Lunch a la Carte from 12:00 to 6:00 pm (opens daily)<br \/> Dinner a la Carte from 6:30 to 11:00 pm, it's closed on Mondays and Fridays<br \/> <br \/> AGAVE:<br \/> Dinner a la Carte from 6:00 pm to 10:30 pm, it's closed on Fridays\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d8555da96386162a32caf01c9f502a87","RawContent":"Jennifer,\n Great information! Thank you!","Attachments":[],"Id":587222,"PostDate":1234223398,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Jennifer,<br \/> Great information! Thank you!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>A Complete Dream~<\/span><br><span>Take a peek @ our photos<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/album.php?aid=99662&id=661814093&l=6c5301b960\">http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/album.php?ai...3&l=6c5301b960<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jamilandtashaforever.wedquarters.com\">www.jamilandtashaforever.wedquarters.com<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10719;25\/st\/20090801\/e\/we%27ve+been+Mr.+%26amp%3B+Mrs~\/k\/514d\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...514d\/event.png<\/a><span>5<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tasha.scott1105@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1232836912,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214254.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":71,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BLUSH*","Id":214254,"Name":"BLUSH*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"693029187b3b9db1109e07fa7bb78dc7","RawContent":"You guys have been very quiet! What&#039;s everyone up to??","Attachments":[],"Id":596140,"PostDate":1234983454,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You guys have been very quiet! What's everyone up to??\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam u