> Time: 1453690486 / Mon, 25 Jan 2016 02:54:46 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=27268&start=70&SessionId=750a88b9352057030c021b25a07510fb
> User Bahinz (285871)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a74323dab82c7b20b8df741e22ad088","RawContent":"Yep! I&#039;m next. I can&#039;t wait! I am so ready for this to be over..hopefully that doesn&#039;t sound bad but I have been so stressed! Everyone is procratinating to book their trip, people are still trying to convince us to have a wedding here at home, the list goes on and on! \n \n We have actually loaded up our IPOD with music so we will not have a dj. I can&#039;t afford the additional money right now but I think the IPOD will be a blast! We are buying the BOSE speakers...which reminds me of something else I need to get! \n \n The centerpieces look nice but I am bringing my own. Target had hot pink sand buckets for $2.50. I am using those for my vases and their was a Pier One here that went out of business and they had these gorgeous hot pink peonies for $2.00 ea. So I bought a ton and it looks so pretty. They aren&#039;t real but at this point I dont care! Now I&#039;m trying to tackle bridesmaids bouquets. I don&#039;t want to pay the resort $50 ea. I guess I&#039;m starting to ramble now but do they provide the aisle runner and rose petals in the packages or is it extra?\n \n Talk to you guys soon! Oh and the new coordinator did contact me she responded to my email within the same day so I was impressed. Although I havent received any details in a spreadsheet...I&#039;m just going with the flow. I can&#039;t wait to be sipping on a cocktail on the beach!","Attachments":[],"Id":639374,"PostDate":1238648788,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yep! I'm next. I can't wait! I am so ready for this to be over..hopefully that doesn't sound bad but I have been so stressed! Everyone is procratinating to book their trip, people are still trying to convince us to have a wedding here at home, the list goes on and on! <br \/> <br \/> We have actually loaded up our IPOD with music so we will not have a dj. I can't afford the additional money right now but I think the IPOD will be a blast! We are buying the BOSE speakers...which reminds me of something else I need to get! <br \/> <br \/> The centerpieces look nice but I am bringing my own. Target had hot pink sand buckets for $2.50. I am using those for my vases and their was a Pier One here that went out of business and they had these gorgeous hot pink peonies for $2.00 ea. So I bought a ton and it looks so pretty. They aren't real but at this point I dont care! Now I'm trying to tackle bridesmaids bouquets. I don't want to pay the resort $50 ea. I guess I'm starting to ramble now but do they provide the aisle runner and rose petals in the packages or is it extra?<br \/> <br \/> Talk to you guys soon! Oh and the new coordinator did contact me she responded to my email within the same day so I was impressed. Although I havent received any details in a spreadsheet...I'm just going with the flow. I can't wait to be sipping on a cocktail on the beach!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Mesita and Durante<\/span><br><span>June 18, 2009<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><br><br><span>My wedding review:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t45032#post857892\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...032#post857892<\/a><span>My wedding pro slideshow:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita\">http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/192\/20090618\/Our+Swine+Flu+Free+Wedding%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/1...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mesita.simms@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221110745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211672.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sensatori Bride","Id":211672,"Name":"Sensatori Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb10f101bf124e5c42e90906565026b0","RawContent":"CONGRATS!!! I would love to hear your thoughts on your recent wedding at the Excellence Playa Mujeres. It&#039;s in my final five resorts for my upcoming October 2009 wedding. Since I&#039;m planning so late, I&#039;m trying to play catch up--and any info, advice would be great. And again, congratulations!","Attachments":[],"Id":642514,"PostDate":1238881145,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                CONGRATS!!! I would love to hear your thoughts on your recent wedding at the Excellence Playa Mujeres. It's in my final five resorts for my upcoming October 2009 wedding. Since I'm planning so late, I'm trying to play catch up--and any info, advice would be great. And again, congratulations!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;80\/st\/20090822\/e\/Lori+%26amp%3B+Alex+\/k\/bc54\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...bc54\/event.png<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...es\/smile29.gif<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bumblebee_287@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238842852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216453.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bumblebee_287","Id":216453,"Name":"bumblebee_287","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eff221f24d1ecf0423de5f6107983c70","RawContent":"&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/fryingpan.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Fryingpan\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; Ok, thats how I feel. I emailed Excellence last week and recieved a response to my question on Wed from the new planner Yasmina. My question specifically was what time can my guest arrive for our 6pm wedding using a wedding pass. The new wedding planner emailed me back the current prices for guest passes, without an answer to my question. Nayeli did a great job I know the prices. I just wanted to know what time my guest could arrive with the Wedding pass. So I decided to try my question again- asking if the wedding starts at 6pm what time can the guest begin to arrive. She again emailed me back the price list for the day pass, the half day pass, and the wedding pass but no times. So I have emailed her the question again stating that I know the prices. OMG how dense is she. I just wanted a simple answer to my question. And I dont think its that complexed of a question but I truly dont think she should be so dense.","Attachments":[],"Id":642583,"PostDate":1238889771,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/fryingpan.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Fryingpan\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> Ok, thats how I feel. I emailed Excellence last week and recieved a response to my question on Wed from the new planner Yasmina. My question specifically was what time can my guest arrive for our 6pm wedding using a wedding pass. The new wedding planner emailed me back the current prices for guest passes, without an answer to my question. Nayeli did a great job I know the prices. I just wanted to know what time my guest could arrive with the Wedding pass. So I decided to try my question again- asking if the wedding starts at 6pm what time can the guest begin to arrive. She again emailed me back the price list for the day pass, the half day pass, and the wedding pass but no times. So I have emailed her the question again stating that I know the prices. OMG how dense is she. I just wanted a simple answer to my question. And I dont think its that complexed of a question but I truly dont think she should be so dense.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"00ae0336f6536946071eed0d138766bf","RawContent":"Questions from a Newbie...hey ladies I just decided on Excellence I am so excited! I have a few basic questions on the blog and Excellence: Lauren where did you get the logo that has your name on it and the resort..I love it! Also is anyone getting married in the gazebo? If so do you know if there are there options for different chairs other than those in the pictures? Also for this blog where do you get the wedding date tickers and how do you add them, I also tried to add a picture of my fianc\u00a9 and me but it didn&#039;t show up any advice?","Attachments":[],"Id":642626,"PostDate":1238893904,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Questions from a Newbie...hey ladies I just decided on Excellence I am so excited! I have a few basic questions on the blog and Excellence: Lauren where did you get the logo that has your name on it and the resort..I love it! Also is anyone getting married in the gazebo? If so do you know if there are there options for different chairs other than those in the pictures? Also for this blog where do you get the wedding date tickers and how do you add them, I also tried to add a picture of my fianc\u00a9 and me but it didn't show up any advice?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/1768\/20100522\/Until+I+Marry+My+Love\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/...ove\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tracihopeis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238572485,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216339.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"thope","Id":216339,"Name":"thope","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e8d371eba0fae29fcb7717263895010","RawContent":"Ok I figured out the picture thing so disregard my last question....thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":642631,"PostDate":1238894282,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ok I figured out the picture thing so disregard my last question....thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/1768\/20100522\/Until+I+Marry+My+Love\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/...ove\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tracihopeis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238572485,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216339.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"thope","Id":216339,"Name":"thope","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dbf59962bb1eda513529f6e0a115c007","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;thope&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Questions from a Newbie...hey ladies I just decided on Excellence I am so excited! I have a few basic questions on the blog and Excellence: Lauren where did you get the logo that has your name on it and the resort..I love it! Also is anyone getting married in the gazebo? If so do you know if there are there options for different chairs other than those in the pictures? Also for this blog where do you get the wedding date tickers and how do you add them, I also tried to add a picture of my fianc\u00a9 and me but it didn&#039;t show up any advice?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Welcome to the Forum Traci, \n \n I actually got my monogram made by Sprollie Designs, Her name is Sara and she does great work. You can find her banner to the right of your screen she should be the third adverstisement. I actually had 5 made by her. \n I am getting married in their gazebo but am unaware if there are other chair options. Lastly, the wedding tickers. If you see one you like on someone elses page, click on it and it should link you to the website where you can create your own. Then copy the address after its made and add it to your signature. Hope this helps. \n \n Lauren","Attachments":[],"Id":642742,"PostDate":1238908286,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>thope<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Questions from a Newbie...hey ladies I just decided on Excellence I am so excited! I have a few basic questions on the blog and Excellence: Lauren where did you get the logo that has your name on it and the resort..I love it! Also is anyone getting married in the gazebo? If so do you know if there are there options for different chairs other than those in the pictures? Also for this blog where do you get the wedding date tickers and how do you add them, I also tried to add a picture of my fianc\u00a9 and me but it didn't show up any advice?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Welcome to the Forum Traci, <br \/> <br \/> I actually got my monogram made by Sprollie Designs, Her name is Sara and she does great work. You can find her banner to the right of your screen she should be the third adverstisement. I actually had 5 made by her. <br \/> I am getting married in their gazebo but am unaware if there are other chair options. Lastly, the wedding tickers. If you see one you like on someone elses page, click on it and it should link you to the website where you can create your own. Then copy the address after its made and add it to your signature. Hope this helps. <br \/> <br \/> Lauren\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"737b8b19bf79a3b15b83cf8c436e26a4","RawContent":"HI lauren,\n \n It&#039;s frustrating sometimes dealing with people who speak english as a second language. I am sure Yamina is not dense - maybe there is just a language barrier there and she is not understanding your question. I have had the same issues while dealing with some of the vendors I am using. I have some suggestions for you:\n \n 1. Rephrase the question and CC nayeli on the note (nayeli speaks EXCELLENT english). \n \n 2. Call Nayeli and just ask her.\n \n 3. Use babelfish to translate your question into spanish: \u00bfCu\u00a1ndo deben las hu\u00a9spedes llegar para mi ceremonia de boda del 6:00 P.M.?","Attachments":[],"Id":642985,"PostDate":1238957761,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                HI lauren,<br \/> <br \/> It's frustrating sometimes dealing with people who speak english as a second language. I am sure Yamina is not dense - maybe there is just a language barrier there and she is not understanding your question. I have had the same issues while dealing with some of the vendors I am using. I have some suggestions for you:<br \/> <br \/> 1. Rephrase the question and CC nayeli on the note (nayeli speaks EXCELLENT english). <br \/> <br \/> 2. Call Nayeli and just ask her.<br \/> <br \/> 3. Use babelfish to translate your question into spanish: \u00bfCu\u00a1ndo deben las hu\u00a9spedes llegar para mi ceremonia de boda del 6:00 P.M.?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c336\/dmbstolio\/Dec122009238-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c3...22009238-1.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jenandken2009.com\">www.jenandken2009.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20091212\/e\/Jen+%26amp%3B+Kenny%27s+wedding\/k\/02c3\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...02c3\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"davis1974@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1215061237,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210302.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":98,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jennifer Davis","Id":210302,"Name":"Jennifer Davis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd89c52bb070b85dfdd6747972ce8f9f","RawContent":"Hi Traci! Welcome to the forum and to our little Excellence Playa Mujeres thread!","Attachments":[],"Id":642986,"PostDate":1238957869,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Traci! Welcome to the forum and to our little Excellence Playa Mujeres thread!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c336\/dmbstolio\/Dec122009238-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c3...22009238-1.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jenandken2009.com\">www.jenandken2009.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20091212\/e\/Jen+%26amp%3B+Kenny%27s+wedding\/k\/02c3\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...02c3\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"davis1974@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1215061237,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210302.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":98,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jennifer Davis","Id":210302,"Name":"Jennifer Davis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"575be3d8ebfdb0e0df4522231867fb3a","RawContent":"What is the day pass fee and hours ? Full day pass cost is $150.00 usd per person from 09:00 am to 11:00 pm. If Only attending the wedding with the Gold Excellence Package will be $70.00 usd per person. And will allow clients to stay for the wedding and reception length. \n \n They would be able to arrive just prior to the wedding- about 15-20 minutes.\n \n Hope that helped! \n \n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;reevesbride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/fryingpan.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Fryingpan\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; Ok, thats how I feel. I emailed Excellence last week and recieved a response to my question on Wed from the new planner Yasmina. My question specifically was what time can my guest arrive for our 6pm wedding using a wedding pass. The new wedding planner emailed me back the current prices for guest passes, without an answer to my question. Nayeli did a great job I know the prices. I just wanted to know what time my guest could arrive with the Wedding pass. So I decided to try my question again- asking if the wedding starts at 6pm what time can the guest begin to arrive. She again emailed me back the price list for the day pass, the half day pass, and the wedding pass but no times. So I have emailed her the question again stating that I know the prices. OMG how dense is she. I just wanted a simple answer to my question. And I dont think its that complexed of a question but I truly dont think she should be so dense.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":643022,"PostDate":1238960327,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                What is the day pass fee and hours ? Full day pass cost is $150.00 usd per person from 09:00 am to 11:00 pm. If Only attending the wedding with the Gold Excellence Package will be $70.00 usd per person. And will allow clients to stay for the wedding and reception length. <br \/> <br \/> They would be able to arrive just prior to the wedding- about 15-20 minutes.<br \/> <br \/> Hope that helped! <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>reevesbride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/fryingpan.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Fryingpan\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> Ok, thats how I feel. I emailed Excellence last week and recieved a response to my question on Wed from the new planner Yasmina. My question specifically was what time can my guest arrive for our 6pm wedding using a wedding pass. The new wedding planner emailed me back the current prices for guest passes, without an answer to my question. Nayeli did a great job I know the prices. I just wanted to know what time my guest could arrive with the Wedding pass. So I decided to try my question again- asking if the wedding starts at 6pm what time can the guest begin to arrive. She again emailed me back the price list for the day pass, the half day pass, and the wedding pass but no times. So I have emailed her the question again stating that I know the prices. OMG how dense is she. I just wanted a simple answer to my question. And I dont think its that complexed of a question but I truly dont think she should be so dense.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1193117580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207874.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferSS","Id":207874,"Name":"JenniferSS","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"68dd12073bf9207f01bd3cbbbfd3859e","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;TA Jennifer&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;What is the day pass fee and hours ? Full day pass cost is $150.00 usd per person from 09:00 am to 11:00 pm. If Only attending the wedding with the Gold Excellence Package will be $70.00 usd per person. And will allow clients to stay for the wedding and reception length. \n \n They would be able to arrive just prior to the wedding- about 15-20 minutes.\n \n Hope that helped!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thank you so much for responding. I was getting quite frustrated trying to re-phrase the question over and over. \n \n Lauren","Attachments":[],"Id":643355,"PostDate":1238984695,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>TA Jennifer<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">What is the day pass fee and hours ? Full day pass cost is $150.00 usd per person from 09:00 am to 11:00 pm. If Only attending the wedding with the Gold Excellence Package will be $70.00 usd per person. And will allow clients to stay for the wedding and reception length. <br \/> <br \/> They would be able to arrive just prior to the wedding- about 15-20 minutes.<br \/> <br \/> Hope that helped!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thank you so much for responding. I was getting quite frustrated trying to re-phrase the question over and over. <br \/> <br \/> Lauren\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":70,"NextPage":80,"PreviousPage":60,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
