{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"78e7b636b735cfcfa7d5aec9fde407da","RawContent":"From what I remember in undergrad Bio- influenza is an RNA virus that can&#039;t spread past the middle ish of spring..( that&#039;s why they call it &amp;quot;flu season&amp;quot; and why you only get flu shots in fall to protect you from &amp;quot;flu season) The bird flu couldn&#039;t cross into summer, so I don&#039;t see how the swine flu could...I think you&#039;ll be alright- you&#039;ve still got some time :)","Attachments":[],"Id":675368,"PostDate":1241152069,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                From what I remember in undergrad Bio- influenza is an RNA virus that can't spread past the middle ish of spring..( that's why they call it \"flu season\" and why you only get flu shots in fall to protect you from \"flu season) The bird flu couldn't cross into summer, so I don't see how the swine flu could...I think you'll be alright- you've still got some time <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;80\/st\/20090822\/e\/Lori+%26amp%3B+Alex+\/k\/bc54\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...bc54\/event.png<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...es\/smile29.gif<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bumblebee_287@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238842852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216453.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bumblebee_287","Id":216453,"Name":"bumblebee_287","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75f6c841d66fee9202a87a35cace9267","RawContent":"Just wanted to tell you guys that we decided to postpone until June 18th. Still a little sad but everything will be fine! I still get to have my beautiful wedding at our beautiful resort!\n \n My ticker sucks! Today would have made 10 days but now it&#039;s 1 month and 14 days. What a bummer!","Attachments":[],"Id":679457,"PostDate":1241497386,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just wanted to tell you guys that we decided to postpone until June 18th. Still a little sad but everything will be fine! I still get to have my beautiful wedding at our beautiful resort!<br \/> <br \/> My ticker sucks! Today would have made 10 days but now it's 1 month and 14 days. What a bummer!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Mesita and Durante<\/span><br><span>June 18, 2009<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><br><br><span>My wedding review:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t45032#post857892\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...032#post857892<\/a><span>My wedding pro slideshow:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita\">http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/192\/20090618\/Our+Swine+Flu+Free+Wedding%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/1...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mesita.simms@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221110745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211672.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sensatori Bride","Id":211672,"Name":"Sensatori Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"794f9eaea0b382330953dee890081d36","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Sensatori Bride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Just wanted to tell you guys that we decided to postpone until June 18th. Still a little sad but everything will be fine! I still get to have my beautiful wedding at our beautiful resort!\n \n My ticker sucks! Today would have made 10 days but now it&#039;s 1 month and 14 days. What a bummer!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I&#039;m glad you were able to change things, I know its not the way you wanted to be, but in the end you&#039;ll be glad you did. For now you just wait, until June continue to search the threads and find more exciting things to add to your special day. I know your bummed right now but just think it will be beautiful and just the way you pictured it with all the guest you want to be their and support you. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":679491,"PostDate":1241499122,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Sensatori Bride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Just wanted to tell you guys that we decided to postpone until June 18th. Still a little sad but everything will be fine! I still get to have my beautiful wedding at our beautiful resort!<br \/> <br \/> My ticker sucks! Today would have made 10 days but now it's 1 month and 14 days. What a bummer!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I'm glad you were able to change things, I know its not the way you wanted to be, but in the end you'll be glad you did. For now you just wait, until June continue to search the threads and find more exciting things to add to your special day. I know your bummed right now but just think it will be beautiful and just the way you pictured it with all the guest you want to be their and support you. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4068454e2ac43f449ccf519076d49f21","RawContent":"Its still so close- June is right around the corner :)","Attachments":[],"Id":679682,"PostDate":1241508419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Its still so close- June is right around the corner <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;80\/st\/20090822\/e\/Lori+%26amp%3B+Alex+\/k\/bc54\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...bc54\/event.png<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...es\/smile29.gif<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bumblebee_287@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238842852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216453.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bumblebee_287","Id":216453,"Name":"bumblebee_287","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21eef6227a6e7448405024a7939cb8fd","RawContent":"&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:tracihopeis@yahoo.com\"&gt;tracihopeis@yahoo.com&lt;\/a&gt; Yeah cake &amp;amp; flower pictures!! Thanks Mesita! Everyone around me is flipped out as well and my date isint for another year..Mexico is getting a bad wrap right now. Do the THOUSANDS of montly car accident fatalites stop people from driving to work!?! I am hoping common sense kicks in for your guests (and mine) some where along the line...my fi&#039;s mom was talking about not coming before the flu..so we probably wont be seeing her..lol..whatever!","Attachments":[],"Id":679714,"PostDate":1241509821,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <a href='mailto:tracihopeis@yahoo.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>tracihopeis@yahoo.com<\/a> Yeah cake & flower pictures!! Thanks Mesita! Everyone around me is flipped out as well and my date isint for another year..Mexico is getting a bad wrap right now. Do the THOUSANDS of montly car accident fatalites stop people from driving to work!?! I am hoping common sense kicks in for your guests (and mine) some where along the line...my fi's mom was talking about not coming before the flu..so we probably wont be seeing her..lol..whatever!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.co