:"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221110745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211672.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sensatori Bride","Id":211672,"Name":"Sensatori Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f7ad1b3f78088e34b3d7f9d8ee223006","RawContent":"I&#039;m actually moving my wedding up to Aug 29th to accomodate my sister&#039;s grad school schedule. My mom is actually supporting it :) His mom says she might not come, but I think she just needed an excuse not to go anyways- who turns down seeing their son get married in Mexico&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; It&#039;s not like I&#039;m asking her to go to antarctica or something! Ya&#039;ll should check with your TAs, apparantly the rates have gone down again...just a thought...","Attachments":[],"Id":682371,"PostDate":1241669753,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm actually moving my wedding up to Aug 29th to accomodate my sister's grad school schedule. My mom is actually supporting it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> His mom says she might not come, but I think she just needed an excuse not to go anyways- who turns down seeing their son get married in Mexico<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> It's not like I'm asking her to go to antarctica or something! Ya'll should check with your TAs, apparantly the rates have gone down again...just a thought...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;80\/st\/20090822\/e\/Lori+%26amp%3B+Alex+\/k\/bc54\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...bc54\/event.png<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...es\/smile29.gif<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bumblebee_287@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238842852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216453.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bumblebee_287","Id":216453,"Name":"bumblebee_287","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd98a4e295b74825155730a8e7c3e555","RawContent":"Oh, I forgot- thanks SO MUCH for the pics of the cakes and flowers!","Attachments":[],"Id":682375,"PostDate":1241669870,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n    