e from her, from what I gather, I wont be disappointed.<br \/> <br \/> TTYL\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yoliejimenez1976@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1243020069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217738.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jewels336","Id":217738,"Name":"Jewels336","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6c3ff3d6c6decc2a030493d7928bb34f","RawContent":"Welcome Jewels! When are you getting married??","Attachments":[],"Id":701156,"PostDate":1243224353,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Welcome Jewels! When are you getting married??\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Mesita and Durante<\/span><br><span>June 18, 2009<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><br><br><span>My wedding review:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t45032#post857892\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...032#post857892<\/a><span>My wedding pro slideshow:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita\">http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/192\/20090618\/Our+Swine+Flu+Free+Wedding%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/1...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mesita.simms@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221110745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211672.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sensatori Bride","Id":211672,"Name":"Sensatori Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"531d7e08107582686245f61f8f2c83f7","RawContent":"Hi Mesita!\n I&#039;m getting married December 5th..and I have NOTHING done..just ideas..lol--Which will get me no where if I dont get on the ball. lol\n \n I see you&#039;re getting married in just a few short weeks! Congratulations..are you all set? I would love to see your pics! Did you hire a photographer or will you be using the resorts photographer?","Attachments":[],"Id":701542,"PostDate":1243280607,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Mesita!<br \/> I'm getting married December 5th..and I have NOTHING done..just ideas..lol--Which will get me no where if I dont get on the ball. lol<br \/> <br \/> I see you're getting married in just a few short weeks! Congratulations..are you all set? I would love to see your pics! Did you hire a photographer or will you be using the resorts photographer?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yoliejimenez1976@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1243020069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217738.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jewels336","Id":217738,"Name":"Jewels336","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe2269f7fc10885f02244fccced9b458","RawContent":"Hey Jewels, \n \n Congrats on your upcoming wedding. Welcome to our little Excellence Playa Mujeres Thread. Hope you find all the posted info helpful. Just a side bar i&#039;m from NJ too, Right now im from Elizabeth but I&#039;ll be moving to East Windsor in a few short weeks. What part are you from.","Attachments":[],"Id":701548,"PostDate":1243281329,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Jewels, <br \/> <br \/> Congrats on your upcoming wedding. Welcome to our little Excellence Playa Mujeres Thread. Hope you find all the posted info helpful. Just a side bar i'm from NJ too, Right now im from Elizabeth but I'll be moving to East Windsor in a few short weeks. What part are you from.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"28c8bb66cdfe7f1fbce74a101a23a902","RawContent":"Hey Jewels! Welcome and happy planning.\n \n I apologize for being MIA - been working on my invitations! Finally finished them with the help of my wonderful fiance this weekend!\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t43128\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t43128&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Hope all is well with you all. So glad for you guys that the swine flu drama is over! \n \n I&#039;m back in action on the boards now!\n \n XOXO!","Attachments":[],"Id":701860,"PostDate":1243306230,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Jewels! Welcome and happy planning.<br \/> <br \/> I apologize for being MIA - been working on my invitations! Finally finished them with the help of my wonderful fiance this weekend!<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t43128' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t43128<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Hope all is well with you all. So glad for you guys that the swine flu drama is over! <br \/> <br \/> I'm back in action on the boards now!<br \/> <br \/> XOXO!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c336\/dmbstolio\/Dec122009238-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c3...22009238-1.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jenandken2009.com\">www.jenandken2009.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20091212\/e\/Jen+%26amp%3B+Kenny%27s+wedding\/k\/02c3\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...02c3\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"davis1974@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1215061237,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210302.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":98,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jennifer Davis","Id":210302,"Name":"Jennifer Davis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f92c2b30f35a15dc88427df932d043d1","RawContent":"Congrats Jewels! Don&#039;t worry about time, I just started a couple months ago with an october date and now mine&#039;s aug. 22. You&#039;ve got plenty of time. That reminds me...I need to change my ticker","Attachments":[],"Id":702151,"PostDate":1243322752,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats Jewels! Don't worry about time, I just started a couple months ago with an october date and now mine's aug. 22. You've got plenty of time. That reminds me...I need to change my ticker\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;80\/st\/20090822\/e\/Lori+%26amp%3B+Alex+\/k\/bc54\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...bc54\/event.png<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...es\/smile29.gif<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bumblebee_287@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238842852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216453.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bumblebee_287","Id":216453,"Name":"bumblebee_287","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd3fde4504c4e535cc3e7cf6ba507e00","RawContent":"Hi Jewels:\n I am bringing my own photographer he is really great. At one point he was a vendor on here but I&#039;m not sure if he still is. I also found out that the videographer the resort uses is Cancun Wedding Videos. So just a word of advice...I coincidentally emailed him for prices before asking the resort who they used. His name his Mike Cantrell and a lot of girls on here use him. The prices he sent me are cheaper than the resort prices!! Not by that much but every little bit helps! The resort has obvisouly added more money to the prices to make a profit. I am thinking that I will book through him and just pay the resort fee.\n \n ~Mesita","Attachments":[],"Id":703301,"PostDate":1243400834,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Jewels:<br \/> I am bringing my own photographer he is really great. At one point he was a vendor on here but I'm not sure if he still is. I also found out that the videographer the resort uses is Cancun Wedding Videos. So just a word of advice...I coincidentally emailed him for prices before asking the resort who they used. His name his Mike Cantrell and a lot of girls on here use him. The prices he sent me are cheaper than the resort prices!! Not by that much but every little bit helps! The resort has obvisouly added more money to the prices to make a profit. I am thinking that I will book through him and just pay the resort fee.<br \/> <br \/> ~Mesita\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Mesita and Durante<\/span><br><span>June 18, 2009<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><br><br><span>My wedding review:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t45032#post857892\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...032#post857892<\/a><span>My wedding pro slideshow:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita\">http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/192\/20090618\/Our+Swine+Flu+Free+Wedding%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/1...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mesita.simms@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221110745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211672.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sensatori Bride","Id":211672,"Name":"Sensatori Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d494debe1510ac13e83d1fc36cd04bfb","RawContent":"Jennifer your invitations are awesome! Good job!","Attachments":[],"Id":703304,"PostDate":1243400921,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Jennifer your invitations are awesome! Good job!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Mesita and Durante<\/span><br><span>June 18, 2009<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><br><br><span>My wedding review:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t45032#post857892\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...032#post857892<\/a><span>My wedding pro slideshow:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita\">http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/192\/20090618\/Our+Swine+Flu+Free+Wedding%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/1...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mesita.simms@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221110745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211672.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sensatori Bride","Id":211672,"Name":"Sensatori Bride","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":160,"NextPage":170,"PreviousPage":150,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
