{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0cc0be8af5280100b14a31d98e770732","RawContent":"Hi girls..\n Someone sent me this link today and I thought I would share it with you girls!!\n Enjoy!\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/wedding1208.googlepages.com\/honeymoon\"&gt;Wedding1208 - Honeymoon&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":716551,"PostDate":1244515458,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi girls..<br \/> Someone sent me this link today and I thought I would share it with you girls!!<br \/> Enjoy!<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/wedding1208.googlepages.com\/honeymoon' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Wedding1208 - Honeymoon<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yoliejimenez1976@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1243020069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217738.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jewels336","Id":217738,"Name":"Jewels336","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ff37cb81095d3a65c9c2191918f707e4","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;reevesbride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I&#039;m not having an outdoor reception but I would like the tip! \n \n Thanks, \n Susana&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Jewels336&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hi I would like to know the tip as well! (My wedding is at 4)&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Well my intend is not to scare anyone... I only want to give you a heads up about something we experienced... we stayed at the resort from May 28th to June 1st and during the last two nights of our stay, there were tons of mosquitos at night. I&#039;m not sure that was all about, but they were eveywhere (balconies, elevator, etc...).\n \n Please check with the WC maybe it was a abnormality during those days...\n \n I hope this helps eveyone and not causes any uncessary stress &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/undecided.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Undecided\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n Susana","Attachments":[],"Id":716598,"PostDate":1244518604,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>reevesbride<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I'm not having an outdoor reception but I would like the tip! <br \/> <br \/> Thanks, <br \/> Susana<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Jewels336<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hi I would like to know the tip as well! (My wedding is at 4)<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Well my intend is not to scare anyone... I only want to give you a heads up about something we experienced... we stayed at the resort from May 28th to June 1st and during the last two nights of our stay, there were tons of mosquitos at night. I'm not sure that was all about, but they were eveywhere (balconies, elevator, etc...).<br \/> <br \/> Please check with the WC maybe it was a abnormality during those days...<br \/> <br \/> I hope this helps eveyone and not causes any uncessary stress <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/undecided.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Undecided\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Susana\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>...<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"susana.beaumont@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1224836944,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212384.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Susanandmo","Id":212384,"Name":"Susanandmo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32855aa336f215764d48d39234bf349f","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Susanandmo&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Well my intend is not to scare anyone... I only want to give you a heads up about something we experienced... we stayed at the resort from May 28th to June 1st and during the last two nights of our stay, there were tons of mosquitos at night. I&#039;m not sure that was all about, but they were eveywhere (balconies, elevator, etc...).\n \n Please check with the WC maybe it was a abnormality during those days...\n \n I hope this helps eveyone and not causes any uncessary stress &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/undecided.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Undecided\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n Susana&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I&#039;ll be sure to have bug spray on hand because my cocktail hour is at 7 and outside. Thanks for the tip. \n \n Lauren","Attachments":[],"Id":716753,"PostDate":1244526348,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Susanandmo<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Well my intend is not to scare anyone... I only want to give you a heads up about something we experienced... we stayed at the resort from May 28th to June 1st and during the last two nights of our stay, there were tons of mosquitos at night. I'm not sure that was all about, but they were eveywhere (balconies, elevator, etc...).<br \/> <br \/> Please check with the WC maybe it was a abnormality during those days...<br \/> <br \/> I hope this helps eveyone and not causes any uncessary stress <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/undecided.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Undecided\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Susana<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I'll be sure to have bug spray on hand because my cocktail hour is at 7 and outside. Thanks for the tip. <br \/> <br \/> Lauren\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"223d7c34dd7ff18f4cd5ce4d88fe7562","RawContent":"Hey ladies..\n \n Has anyone had any luck on the phones with Yamina? \n I sent her one on May 29th and I still havent heard back &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; \n \n I figured I would give her 2 weeks (but in my mind I just keep thinking--thats crazy! 2 weeks to respond to an email??)\n I might give it another week..we&#039;ll see.","Attachments":[],"Id":717675,"PostDate":1244590284,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey ladies..<br \/> <br \/> Has anyone had any luck on the phones with Yamina? <br \/> I sent her one on May 29th and I still havent heard back <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> <br \/> <br \/> I figured I would give her 2 weeks (but in my mind I just keep thinking--thats crazy! 2 weeks to respond to an email??)<br \/> I might give it another week..we'll see.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yoliejimenez1976@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1243020069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217738.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jewels336","Id":217738,"Name":"Jewels336","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2341420ac2eda15295e60d467870cd3e","RawContent":"Jewels, 2 weeks is a very long time but its not unusual for her. I finally heard back from her today after sending an email 5 days ago and my wedding is next week! I think they are under staffed and have an influx of wedding emails!","Attachments":[],"Id":718156,"PostDate":1244612273,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Jewels, 2 weeks is a very long time but its not unusual for her. I finally heard back from her today after sending an email 5 days ago and my wedding is next week! I think they are under staffed and have an influx of wedding emails!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Mesita and Durante<\/span><br><span>June 18, 2009<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><br><br><span>My wedding review:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t45032#post857892\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...032#post857892<\/a><span>My wedding pro slideshow:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita\">http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/192\/20090618\/Our+Swine+Flu+Free+Wedding%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/1...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mesita.simms@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221110745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211672.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sensatori Bride","Id":211672,"Name":"Sensatori Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df5c2549c7070574de9cc8ad9fb67248","RawContent":"Thanks Mesita..I&#039;m really trying to be patient..but it really is hard. Especially since some of the questions I have just need to be clarified. I told FI to get me a calling card. though with my luck, I&#039;ll just keep getting the voicemail..lol\n On another note..I cant wait to hear about your wedding!","Attachments":[],"Id":720028,"PostDate":1244745273,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks Mesita..I'm really trying to be patient..but it really is hard. Especially since some of the questions I have just need to be clarified. I told FI to get me a calling card. though with my luck, I'll just keep getting the voicemail..lol<br \/> On another note..I cant wait to hear about your wedding!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yoliejimenez1976@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1243020069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217738.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jewels336","Id":217738,"Name":"Jewels336","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2369fca63ddf2ffaac2d1e3464804d10","RawContent":"What questions do you have maybe some of us can help?","Attachments":[],"Id":720546,"PostDate":1244764179,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                What questions do you have maybe some of us can help?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Mesita and Durante<\/span><br><span>June 18, 2009<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><br><br><span>My wedding review:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t45032#post857892\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...032#post857892<\/a><span>My wedding pro slideshow:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita\">http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/192\/20090618\/Our+Swine+Flu+Free+Wedding%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/1...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mesita.simms@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221110745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211672.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sensatori Bride","Id":211672,"Name":"Sensatori Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6b536294c82cb13391a06918be703a4e","RawContent":"Jeesh as informative as you ladies have been you would think I wouldve thought of it! lol....I swear Im such a dumb a&amp;amp;&amp;amp; sometimes...lmao!\n \n Thank you for offering! Ok here goes...\n \n I plan on purchasing the gold package...I know some decor is included for the ceremony but I would need to know what in order to know what I have to prepare for.\n I planned on using the gazebo, so I dont know if I need a runner for the little foot path over the pool or not? If I change my mind and want to get married on the beach, do they provide an arch?\n This was a long shot question but I had to ask because it would kill me not to know..lol\n You know on the website it shows a young couple in the gazebo and its all decorated with lanterns, and stones..do you think they can provide that set up as part of the package? (like the extra decor they offer in the gold package)\n \n ***goodness now that Im reading this back Im thinking shes probably so irritated at the questions..shes just ignoring me..lol***\n \n IF any of you ladies can help out with the answers I really would appreciate it.\n Oh one more..lol..I planned on purchasing a specific tequila as favors..I can order them online but they are pretty expensive (i want the large bottles) and I am figuring about 15-20 bottles...for those that might have done a site visit..will it be easy (and cheaper!) for me to just wait to purchase the tequila once I arrive and just prepare them at the resort with favor tags? or am I taking a risk by waiting?\n \n Thanks again!","Attachments":[],"Id":720796,"PostDate":1244777267,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Jeesh as informative as you ladies have been you would think I wouldve thought of it! lol....I swear Im such a dumb a&& sometimes...lmao!<br \/> <br \/> Thank you for offering! Ok here goes...<br \/> <br \/> I plan on purchasing the gold package...I know some decor is included for the ceremony but I would need to know what in order to know what I have to prepare for.<br \/> I planned on using the gazebo, so I dont know if I need a runner for the little foot path over the pool or not? If I change my mind and want to get married on the beach, do they provide an arch?<br \/> This was a long shot question but I had to ask because it would kill me not to know..lol<br \/> You know on the website it shows a young couple in the gazebo and its all decorated with lanterns, and stones..do you think they can provide that set up as part of the package? (like the extra decor they offer in the gold package)<br \/> <br \/> ***goodness now that Im reading this back Im thinking shes probably so irritated at the questions..shes just ignoring me..lol***<br \/> <br \/> IF any of you ladies can help out with the answers I really would appreciate it.<br \/> Oh one more..lol..I planned on purchasing a specific tequila as favors..I can order them online but they are pretty expensive (i want the large bottles) and I am figuring about 15-20 bottles...for those that might have done a site visit..will it be easy (and cheaper!) for me to just wait to purchase the tequila once I arrive and just prepare them at the resort with favor tags? or am I taking a risk by waiting?<br \/> <br \/> Thanks again!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yoliejimenez1976@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1243020069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217738.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jewels336","Id":217738,"Name":"Jewels336","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c4f635ad47071877185be22588543732","RawContent":"So with the gazebo pic you saw the lanterns and stones are included. You also have the choice of doing seashells. I am still waiting to get clarification on the runner. I think they charge like $150 for the rose petals! I will let you know once I get back. \n \n If you opt to do the beach the arch is $500 or I believe they have a cheaper option for $250 which was offered to me.\n \n Im not sure about the tequila! I did not go on a site visit. For my AHR we are doing mini tequilas and mini margarita mixes that say our name and wedding date with &amp;quot;The Perfect Mix&amp;quot;!","Attachments":[],"Id":721022,"PostDate":1244793287,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So with the gazebo pic you saw the lanterns and stones are included. You also have the choice of doing seashells. I am still waiting to get clarification on the runner. I think they charge like $150 for the rose petals! I will let you know once I get back. <br \/> <br \/> If you opt to do the beach the arch is $500 or I believe they have a cheaper option for $250 which was offered to me.<br \/> <br \/> Im not sure about the tequila! I did not go on a site visit. For my AHR we are doing mini tequilas and mini margarita mixes that say our name and wedding date with \"The Perfect Mix\"!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Mesita and Durante<\/span><br><span>June 18, 2009<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><br><br><span>My wedding review:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t45032#post857892\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...032#post857892<\/a><span>My wedding pro slideshow:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita\">http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/192\/20090618\/Our+Swine+Flu+Free+Wedding%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/1...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mesita.simms@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221110745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211672.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sensatori Bride","Id":211672,"Name":"Sensatori Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b1989dacefd0001fcadc43c44125a73c","RawContent":"Mesita\n I am sooo sorry your guests did not rebook- I mean it&#039;s just the flu. Something like 30,000 people die every year from the regular flu. I mean you could also get hit by a bus too...\n I can say all this because I am a physician and really believe the whole thing is overblown.\n Sorry again. I hope you both still have an amazing time and we all can&#039;t wait to hear about it!!!! \n Rachel","Attachments":[],"Id":721540,"PostDate":1244845999,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Mesita<br \/> I am sooo sorry your guests did not rebook- I mean it's just the flu. Something like 30,000 people die every year from the regular flu. I mean you could also get hit by a bus too...<br \/> I can say all this because I am a physician and really believe the whole thing is overblown.<br \/> Sorry again. I hope you both still have an amazing time and we all can't wait to hear about it!!!! <br \/> Rachel\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rjchas0@email.uky.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1240711613,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217053.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rjchas0","Id":217053,"Name":"rjchas0","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":190,"NextPage":200,"PreviousPage":180,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
