{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"56443b05dd22a5b8bc9a9c49ff1e1429","RawContent":"Hi ladies!\n Mesita Sorry its taken me so long respond..I have not been on the forums for quite some time. My computer at wor has been freezing up lately when I try to log in, and by the time I get in from the gym and eat dinner, thats it, Im done for the night..lol\n I just want to say that you looked absolutely beautiful and I am so glad to read that everything went perfectly for you! Only one guest has booked for my wedding, but after reading your post, I am just refocusing on the idea that it will be perfect even if its just him and I. Thanks again for posting! \n \n Lauren- GOOD LUCK!!! I hope your experience is a GREAT ONE!","Attachments":[],"Id":752798,"PostDate":1247153897,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies!<br \/> Mesita Sorry its taken me so long respond..I have not been on the forums for quite some time. My computer at wor has been freezing up lately when I try to log in, and by the time I get in from the gym and eat dinner, thats it, Im done for the night..lol<br \/> I just want to say that you looked absolutely beautiful and I am so glad to read that everything went perfectly for you! Only one guest has booked for my wedding, but after reading your post, I am just refocusing on the idea that it will be perfect even if its just him and I. Thanks again for posting! <br \/> <br \/> Lauren- GOOD LUCK!!! I hope your experience is a GREAT ONE!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yoliejimenez1976@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1243020069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217738.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jewels336","Id":217738,"Name":"Jewels336","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a7abbe67103e7e8330aea2a437a9fb0","RawContent":"Lauren...have a wonderful day!!! I&#039;m so excited for you!!&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n Mesita...wow wow wow wow..and more wow...the pix the dress(s) the flowers..wow..&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile78.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile78\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n Wedding website done &lt;u&gt;traciandlee.com&lt;\/u&gt; excpet for the music part..still working on it..&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bunny_4.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bunny 4\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":755659,"PostDate":1247360260,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Lauren...have a wonderful day!!! I'm so excited for you!!<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile03.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile03\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> Mesita...wow wow wow wow..and more wow...the pix the dress(s) the flowers..wow..<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile78.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile78\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> Wedding website done <u>traciandlee.com<\/u> excpet for the music part..still working on it..<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bunny_4.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bunny 4\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/1768\/20100522\/Until+I+Marry+My+Love\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/...ove\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tracihopeis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238572485,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216339.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"thope","Id":216339,"Name":"thope","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"80fd9a1746fbe242d1b19ac13a7b41a8","RawContent":"First off, Traci your website looks great! You truly spent quite a bit of time on it.* Well ladies this will be my last post before I leave tomorrow morning.* I plan to have a great time and an awesome experience.* Thank you guys so much for all your care a concern and positive feedback throughout the planning process.* I&#039;ll be sure to post feedback and pics upon my return, but for now so long.* Lauren","Attachments":[],"Id":756833,"PostDate":1247460710,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                First off, Traci your website looks great! You truly spent quite a bit of time on it.* Well ladies this will be my last post before I leave tomorrow morning.* I plan to have a great time and an awesome experience.* Thank you guys so much for all your care a concern and positive feedback throughout the planning process.* I'll be sure to post feedback and pics upon my return, but for now so long.* Lauren\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b6fc64f38c61d4690f31a88249cf1912","RawContent":"Thanks ladies!\n \n Jewels, I&#039;m so glad that I have inspired you. It definitely won&#039;t matter how many people are there because you will be so happy and in another world!\n \n Thanks so much Traci!!\n \n I can&#039;t wait until Lauren gets back!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":767287,"PostDate":1248123361,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks ladies!<br \/> <br \/> Jewels, I'm so glad that I have inspired you. It definitely won't matter how many people are there because you will be so happy and in another world!<br \/> <br \/> Thanks so much Traci!!<br \/> <br \/> I can't wait until Lauren gets back!!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Mesita and Durante<\/span><br><span>June 18, 2009<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><br><br><span>My wedding review:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t45032#post857892\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...032#post857892<\/a><span>My wedding pro slideshow:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita\">http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/192\/20090618\/Our+Swine+Flu+Free+Wedding%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/1...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mesita.simms@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221110745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211672.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sensatori Bride","Id":211672,"Name":"Sensatori Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"83e9ae4fc0aaafdaecb8071a6b696314","RawContent":"So Mesita lets talk about your wonderfull pix...did you pay for your photgrapher to fly out I noticed he isint a local to mexico?...did you get a good deal or did you bite the bullet and pay a ton...it looks like you did..they are awesome?","Attachments":[],"Id":767960,"PostDate":1248146781,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So Mesita lets talk about your wonderfull pix...did you pay for your photgrapher to fly out I noticed he isint a local to mexico?...did you get a good deal or did you bite the bullet and pay a ton...it looks like you did..they are awesome?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/1768\/20100522\/Until+I+Marry+My+Love\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/...ove\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tracihopeis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238572485,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216339.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"thope","Id":216339,"Name":"thope","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a2aa3f738102b5fe3be8bb5fa469f8e","RawContent":"Hey Girls.\n I have a question regarding menu and guests...I got asked Yamina if they needed to know what my guests will be having for dinner before the wedding reception and she said yes. So my question is, did you guys include (or will you include) a menu option card with your invitations? Mesita Im curious how you handled that because I know you did the passport invite, which is what I doing as well (Jessica&#039;s doing them!).\n I tend to look at things a little more difficult than what they are so any suggestions on how to handle this would be great! \n Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":770590,"PostDate":1248286329,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Girls.<br \/> I have a question regarding menu and guests...I got asked Yamina if they needed to know what my guests will be having for dinner before the wedding reception and she said yes. So my question is, did you guys include (or will you include) a menu option card with your invitations? Mesita Im curious how you handled that because I know you did the passport invite, which is what I doing as well (Jessica's doing them!).<br \/> I tend to look at things a little more difficult than what they are so any suggestions on how to handle this would be great! <br \/> Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yoliejimenez1976@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1243020069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217738.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jewels336","Id":217738,"Name":"Jewels336","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a0bc96026f49830bd33c24ef9b2b5e5d","RawContent":"Hello Ladies, \n \n I&#039;m back from a fabulous 10days at Excellence Playa Mujeres, everything was great! Yamina was wonderful and was able to carry out my every desire. Even with me giving her an entire suit case full of stuff to prepare and layout. She was extremly busy however, with a wedding on almost everyday I was there. I&#039;ll post more later but for now I just wanted to let you all know that my experience was great.\n \n Lauren&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/album.php?id=9500465&amp;amp;aid=2087765#\/photo.php?pid=2192964&amp;amp;id=684504681\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/album.php?id=9500465&amp;amp;aid=2087765#\/photo.php?pid=2192964&amp;amp;id=684504681\"&gt;http:\/\/http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/album...4&amp;amp;id=684504681&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":773445,"PostDate":1248424465,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello Ladies, <br \/> <br \/> I'm back from a fabulous 10days at Excellence Playa Mujeres, everything was great! Yamina was wonderful and was able to carry out my every desire. Even with me giving her an entire suit case full of stuff to prepare and layout. She was extremly busy however, with a wedding on almost everyday I was there. I'll post more later but for now I just wanted to let you all know that my experience was great.<br \/> <br \/> Lauren<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/album.php?id=9500465&aid=2087765#\/photo.php?pid=2192964&id=684504681\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/album.php?id=9500465&aid=2087765#\/photo.php?pid=2192964&id=684504681' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/http:\/\/www.fa....4&id=684504681<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"83818a895c25e6b201fcb81b36f4e3ed","RawContent":"Hey Lauren!\n Welcome back and Congratulations!! Im glad to hear everything went well! Cant wait to hear all the details!!","Attachments":[],"Id":773557,"PostDate":1248455773,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Lauren!<br \/> Welcome back and Congratulations!! Im glad to hear everything went well! Cant wait to hear all the details!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yoliejimenez1976@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1243020069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217738.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jewels336","Id":217738,"Name":"Jewels336","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"639e504b02eb1b8757e273598340a735","RawContent":"Yay Lauren!!! I&#039;m loving the pic! About to log onto facebook to check out your album and request you to be a friend!!\n \n So Tracy I did fly my photographer with me and paid for his hotel stay. I did get a good deal with negotiating but it was still a big investment for me! So I had to save for it but it was worth every penny! Do you still need a photog? Call him and tell him I referred you...he will work out a good deal. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\"&gt;Virginia Beach Wedding Photographer, Hampton Roads Wedding Photographer, Beach Weddings&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":773564,"PostDate":1248456175,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yay Lauren!!! I'm loving the pic! About to log onto facebook to check out your album and request you to be a friend!!<br \/> <br \/> So Tracy I did fly my photographer with me and paid for his hotel stay. I did get a good deal with negotiating but it was still a big investment for me! So I had to save for it but it was worth every penny! Do you still need a photog? Call him and tell him I referred you...he will work out a good deal. <a href='http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Virginia Beach Wedding Photographer, Hampton Roads Wedding Photographer, Beach Weddings<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Mesita and Durante<\/span><br><span>June 18, 2009<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><br><br><span>My wedding review:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t45032#post857892\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...032#post857892<\/a><span>My wedding pro slideshow:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita\">http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/192\/20090618\/Our+Swine+Flu+Free+Wedding%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/1...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mesita.simms@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221110745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211672.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sensatori Bride","Id":211672,"Name":"Sensatori Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"29b2067840a0cd81b42bd7e543b3508e","RawContent":"Lauren the link won