quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Lauren the link won't work for me..Is your facebook page under Lauren Brown<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Lauren N. BrownNorth Jersey Network\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bbad3f27c3d9ca35cd75d99e3e781c80","RawContent":"Hey Lauren....so glad it went well..just talking with you all makes me know everyone of us will have a perfect wedding..btw Lauren I&#039;m so not up with times..I&#039;m not on facebook, my space, twitter, nada. So when you get your pix can you post them I would love to see them.\n Mesita I&#039;ll see about the photog..if i dont find anyone less expensive i like i may set up a registry for them...keep you posted.\n \n Also ladies if anyone is interested Yamina can get Tiffany\/Chivari Chairs $7 per chair. Which would save the 100.00 vendor fee if you get them through her.....&lt;font color=\"Purple\"&gt;Peace &amp;amp; Love&lt;\/font&gt;\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/traciandlee.com\"&gt;http:\/\/traciandlee.com&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":779264,"PostDate":1248835886,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Lauren....so glad it went well..just talking with you all makes me know everyone of us will have a perfect wedding..btw Lauren I'm so not up with times..I'm not on facebook, my space, twitter, nada. So when you get your pix can you post them I would love to see them.<br \/> Mesita I'll see about the photog..if i dont find anyone less expensive i like i may set up a registry for them...keep you posted.<br \/> <br \/> Also ladies if anyone is interested Yamina can get Tiffany\/Chivari Chairs $7 per chair. Which would save the 100.00 vendor fee if you get them through her.....<font color=\"Purple\">Peace & Love<\/font><br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/traciandlee.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/traciandlee.com<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/1768\/20100522\/Until+I+Marry+My+Love\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/...ove\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tracihopeis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238572485,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216339.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"thope","Id":216339,"Name":"thope","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"44f08583c9946f15c6665e6d51d1748c","RawContent":"Hey ladies, I just wanted to say that this thread has been very informative. I have not made a decision on where I want to have my dw, but now I am seriously considering EPM. From the wedding pictures I have seen I don&#039;t think I can go wrong with this resort.\n Quick question Mesita did you bring a pic down for your hair or did you just describe the look you were going for?","Attachments":[],"Id":781302,"PostDate":1248942804,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey ladies, I just wanted to say that this thread has been very informative. I have not made a decision on where I want to have my dw, but now I am seriously considering EPM. From the wedding pictures I have seen I don't think I can go wrong with this resort.<br \/> Quick question Mesita did you bring a pic down for your hair or did you just describe the look you were going for?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20100417\/e\/the+wedding+of+my+dreams\/dt\/-1\/k\/0f53\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...0f53\/event.png<\/a><br><br><i><strong>Excellence Playa Mujeres Bride<br>April 17, 2010<\/strong><\/i><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wukvjpB\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...jpB\/weight.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"s_katrese@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1229629965,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213251.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"s_katrese","Id":213251,"Name":"s_katrese","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0830b8fbb665fe96cf6642fbe8f8435f","RawContent":"Hi Katrese. You should defnitely pick EPM it is awesome! I did bring a picture with me. I was totally nervous but it turned out just fine. She even knew how to put weave in my bun and they had really good flat irons!!","Attachments":[],"Id":781527,"PostDate":1248974204,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Katrese. You should defnitely pick EPM it is awesome! I did bring a picture with me. I was totally nervous but it turned out just fine. She even knew how to put weave in my bun and they had really good flat irons!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Mesita and Durante<\/span><br><span>June 18, 2009<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><br><br><span>My wedding review:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t45032#post857892\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...032#post857892<\/a><span>My wedding pro slideshow:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita\">http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/192\/20090618\/Our+Swine+Flu+Free+Wedding%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/1...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mesita.simms@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221110745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211672.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sensatori Bride","Id":211672,"Name":"Sensatori Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b31e3635928a738c4be2ecf4ca278ae7","RawContent":"I wanted to ask what type of rooms you ladies booked for yourselves during your stay at EPM and how long will you stay in Mexico (weeks, days, etc...)?\n \n Also for those brides who have already returned how was the food honestly... for myself and fi food quality and taste is a must. We even let our TA know that with our resort we were looking for one that served great food. Is it a hit or miss thing?","Attachments":[],"Id":783297,"PostDate":1249073847,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I wanted to ask what type of rooms you ladies booked for yourselves during your stay at EPM and how long will you stay in Mexico (weeks, days, etc...)?<br \/> <br \/> Also for those brides who have already returned how was the food honestly... for myself and fi food quality and taste is a must. We even let our TA know that with our resort we were looking for one that served great food. Is it a hit or miss thing?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20100417\/e\/the+wedding+of+my+dreams\/dt\/-1\/k\/0f53\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...0f53\/event.png<\/a><br><br><i><strong>Excellence Playa Mujeres Bride<br>April 17, 2010<\/strong><\/i><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wukvjpB\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...jpB\/weight.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"s_katrese@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1229629965,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213251.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"s_katrese","Id":213251,"Name":"s_katrese","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a40c0e481ef98b117125cccca2c5f4c8","RawContent":"Our experience with the food was great. Breakfast was awesome, so was lunch. My favorite restaurants for dinner were Spice and Agave. I only had a bad dinner on one night...so in my opinion the food is great. And if you don&#039;t like it let them know and i&#039;m sure they will make it perfect for you!","Attachments":[],"Id":783645,"PostDate":1249087148,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Our experience with the food was great. Breakfast was awesome, so was lunch. My favorite restaurants for dinner were Spice and Agave. I only had a bad dinner on one night...so in my opinion the food is great. And if you don't like it let them know and i'm sure they will make it perfect for you!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Mesita and Durante<\/span><br><span>June 18, 2009<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><br><br><span>My wedding review:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t45032#post857892\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...032#post857892<\/a><span>My wedding pro slideshow:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita\">http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/192\/20090618\/Our+Swine+Flu+Free+Wedding%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/1...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mesita.simms@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221110745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211672.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sensatori Bride","Id":211672,"Name":"Sensatori Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"65bfdfbcd4d5c2ef5776c6ad4c9b4f5d","RawContent":"Oh and Katrese I just realized that you live in Houston!!! I may be moving there in the very near future. We are waiting to see if my husband will get into law school there. So keep your fingers crossed for us!! How do you like Houston?\n \n PS...we stayed for 7 nights in room 8464 and it was awesome! It was the excellence club roof top terrace on the top floor. The view was great!","Attachments":[],"Id":783648,"PostDate":1249087257,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Oh and Katrese I just realized that you live in Houston!!! I may be moving there in the very near future. We are waiting to see if my husband will get into law school there. So keep your fingers crossed for us!! How do you like Houston?<br \/> <br \/> PS...we stayed for 7 nights in room 8464 and it was awesome! It was the excellence club roof top terrace on the top floor. The view was great!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Mesita and Durante<\/span><br><span>June 18, 2009<\/span><br><span>Excellence Playa Mujeres<\/span><br><br><span>My wedding review:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t45032#post857892\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...032#post857892<\/a><span>My wedding pro slideshow:<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita\">http:\/\/www.keithcephus.com\/mesita<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/192\/20090618\/Our+Swine+Flu+Free+Wedding%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/947\/1...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mesita.simms@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1221110745,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211672.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sensatori Bride","Id":211672,"Name":"Sensatori Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc165e800409956b7751e3bbb3dd55d9","RawContent":"Hey everyone! \n I am getting married at EPM on March 27th, 2010. I am sooooooo excited. Just wondering what were your options for ceremony music? Can they play anything you want if you bring a cd? And did they do a rehersal the day before or right before the ceremony?","Attachments":[],"Id":785083,"PostDate":1249214326,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey everyone! <br \/> I am getting married at EPM on March 27th, 2010. I am sooooooo excited. Just wondering what were your options for ceremony music? Can they play anything you want if you bring a cd? And did they do a rehersal the day before or right before the ceremony?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/pwa8adxad.png\">http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/pwa8adxad.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"weimsrking@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1248402182,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219759.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"weimsrking","Id":219759,"Name":"weimsrking","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02def1ddf45a530340bb46ca061108a7","RawContent":"Hello Ladies, \n \n I know its been along time since my last post. Im really sorry but i&#039;ve been soo busy trying to set up my new house and fulfill my prior obligations. I truly plan to post a review ASAP. I did want to make comments on some previous post. Congrats to all the new Excellence Playa Mujeres Brides. \n \n Weimsrking- the music options are their cd, your own cd, or ipod plug in. I opted for the Ipod plug in so you can plan your music accordingly. As far as the food. overall I found the food to be good. Some rest. were better then others. The best meal I had over the course of my 10day stay was at my Wedding Reception. But Chez Isbelle&#039;s was a close second. My husband could be considered a Foody he truly enjoyed the food. \n \n S-Katrese-my guest stayed at Excellence 5 days and my husband and I stayed 10 days total. We got married on the 3 day after arrival then hung with our guest another day before they left Friday morning. Honestly I dont feel like our honeymoon truly started until they left. But I was truly fun while they were their. \n \n I dont remember who asked but if your ask for one their is a walk thru the day before your wedding. Just asked Yamina she&#039;ll take care if it for you. \n \n We had our wedding at Chez Isbelle&#039;s it was great I loved the room it was truly elegent. \n \n \n Pic&#039;s are coming soon I promise. \n \n Lauren","Attachments":[],"Id":786691,"PostDate":1249361883,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello Ladies, <br \/> <br \/> I know its been along time since my last post. Im really sorry but i've been soo busy trying to set up my new house and fulfill my prior obligations. I truly plan to post a review ASAP. I did want to make comments on some previous post. Congrats to all the new Excellence Playa Mujeres Brides. <br \/> <br \/> Weimsrking- the music options are their cd, your own cd, or ipod plug in. I opted for the Ipod plug in so you can plan your music accordingly. As far as the food. overall I found the food to be good. Some rest. were better then others. The best meal I had over the course of my 10day stay was at my Wedding Reception. But Chez Isbelle's was a close second. My husband could be considered a Foody he truly enjoyed the food. <br \/> <br \/> S-Katrese-my guest stayed at Excellence 5 days and my husband and I stayed 10 days total. We got married on the 3 day after arrival then hung with our guest another day before they left Friday morning. Honestly I dont feel like our honeymoon truly started until they left. But I was truly fun while they were their. <br \/> <br \/> I dont remember who asked but if your ask for one their is a walk thru the day before your wedding. Just asked Yamina she'll take care if it for you. <br \/> <br \/> We had our wedding at Chez Isbelle's it was great I loved the room it was truly elegent. <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Pic's are coming soon I promise. <br \/> <br \/> Lauren\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png\">http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/6qscsou.png<\/a><br><span>[\/CENTER]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"reeveswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219377984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211327.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"reevesbride","Id":211327,"Name":"reevesbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cb1a460e4e75318cc6da7c280bbb8267","RawContent":"Mesita- I will cross my fingers for you and the hubby. I LOVE Houston however, it is hot hot hot. \n \n I now have a tentative date of April 17 @ 6pm does that seem a little late to anyone?","Attachments":[],"Id":786743,"PostDate":1249363780,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Mesita- I will cross my fingers for you and the hubby. I LOVE Houston however, it is hot hot hot. <br \/> <br \/> I now have a tentative date of April 17 @ 6pm does that seem a little late to anyone?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20100417\/e\/the+wedding+of+my+dreams\/dt\/-1\/k\/0f53\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...0f53\/event.png<\/a><br><br><i><strong>Excellence Playa Mujeres Bride<br>April 17, 2010<\/strong><\/i><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wukvjpB\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...jpB\/weight.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"s_katrese@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1229629965,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213251.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"s_katrese","Id":213251,"Name":"s_katrese","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":260,"NextPage":270,"PreviousPage":250,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
