> Time: 1453734448 / Mon, 25 Jan 2016 15:07:28 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=53458&start=20&SessionId=81df14a1b65cddbec88a82cbf3c4361a
> User JodieLawrence (286032)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53458,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb25bb9a25a2988607fbcb293834fdab","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey everyone,\n \n I am currently overseas (sandbox) and I am trying to do some scouting to give my wife the wedding the she always deserved. We have been married for almost 4 years now and just did a JoP while I was stationed in Alaska. We will be going to the lower 48 after this tour so prices wont be outrageous. I am looking into doing the Sandals Whitehouse Jamaica which I have read great things. I was wondering &#039;Josie&#039; if I as well could get that kit.....my email is phillyborn20@yahoo.com. I am looking to have 9 people including my wife and I and our 2 kids ( although Idk if that is possible).\n \n Though any other information you all have would fall upon listening ears.\n \n Thanks,\n Aaron&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1456053,"PostDate":1306058293,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey everyone,<br \/> <br \/> I am currently overseas (sandbox) and I am trying to do some scouting to give my wife the wedding the she always deserved. We have been married for almost 4 years now and just did a JoP while I was stationed in Alaska. We will be going to the lower 48 after this tour so prices wont be outrageous. I am looking into doing the Sandals Whitehouse Jamaica which I have read great things. I was wondering 'Josie' if I as well could get that kit.....my email is phillyborn20@yahoo.com. I am looking to have 9 people including my wife and I and our 2 kids ( although Idk if that is possible).<br \/> <br \/> Though any other information you all have would fall upon listening ears.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks,<br \/> Aaron<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"phillyborn20@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1306057925,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240266.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"phillyborn9184","Id":240266,"Name":"phillyborn9184","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53458,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c2a0916a6dea17f2e11c5d3fe063f69","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wilsonj2...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m planning my wedding at Sandals Montego Bay for May 2012. Would you mind sending me the wedding kit?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My FI and are are paying to have our parents attend, and are expecting between 16-20 people including bride and groom. I am wanting to do the beautiful beginnings package just to keep costs in check, but am a bit worried that the ceremony location and reception table will be barren without upgrading.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I would totally appreciate any info you have to share.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks in advance. Please email me at: mm_cookie@hotmail.com&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1478914,"PostDate":1309403935,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wilsonj2...<\/p> <p> I'm planning my wedding at Sandals Montego Bay for May 2012. Would you mind sending me the wedding kit?<\/p> <p> My FI and are are paying to have our parents attend, and are expecting between 16-20 people including bride and groom. I am wanting to do the beautiful beginnings package just to keep costs in check, but am a bit worried that the ceremony location and reception table will be barren without upgrading.<\/p> <p> I would totally appreciate any info you have to share.<\/p> <p> Thanks in advance. Please email me at: mm_cookie@hotmail.com<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mm_cookie@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1308841402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241478.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Honeylime","Id":241478,"Name":"Honeylime","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53458,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a91d539d86ff19bd7b06eee9621b0fc0","RawContent":"Hello! I just saw your post and was wondering if you received the wedding kit yet? We are getting married at the Sandals Grande St. Lucian April 14, 2012 and I do have the kits if you still need them. I also attended my best friend&#039;s wedding last year at Beaches Negril (all the same wedding packages) so I have a bit of extra experience from that also. It was beautiful by the way!! I also have been to Montego Bay a couple times (once at Sandals) so let me know if I can be of any help!! Looks like we are on a similar wedding countdown too!! Happy Planning!!! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Honeylime[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Wilsonj2... \n I&#039;m planning my wedding at Sandals Montego Bay for May 2012. Would you mind sending me the wedding kit? \n My FI and are are paying to have our parents attend, and are expecting between 16-20 people including bride and groom. I am wanting to do the beautiful beginnings package just to keep costs in check, but am a bit worried that the ceremony location and reception table will be barren without upgrading. \n I would totally appreciate any info you have to share. \n Thanks in advance. Please email me at: mm_cookie@hotmail.com[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1501034,"PostDate":1312816933,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> Hello! I just saw your post and was wondering if you received the wedding kit yet? We are getting married at the Sandals Grande St. Lucian April 14, 2012 and I do have the kits if you still need them. I also attended my best friend's wedding last year at Beaches Negril (all the same wedding packages) so I have a bit of extra experience from that also. It was beautiful by the way!! I also have been to Montego Bay a couple times (once at Sandals) so let me know if I can be of any help!! Looks like we are on a similar wedding countdown too!! Happy Planning!!!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Honeylime<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Wilsonj2...<\/p> <p> I'm planning my wedding at Sandals Montego Bay for May 2012. Would you mind sending me the wedding kit?<\/p> <p> My FI and are are paying to have our parents attend, and are expecting between 16-20 people including bride and groom. I am wanting to do the beautiful beginnings package just to keep costs in check, but am a bit worried that the ceremony location and reception table will be barren without upgrading.<\/p> <p> I would totally appreciate any info you have to share.<\/p> <p> Thanks in advance. Please email me at: mm_cookie@hotmail.com<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Staying strong through a cancelled engagement\/wedding. Thankful for all the ladies here and hoping the best for everyone!!! xoxo<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jridpath7@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1310575855,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242290.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stluciabound","Id":242290,"Name":"stluciabound","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53458,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"deb2576b44040f7af3289dc0eaddb319","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Stluciabound,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks so much for offering to help with your experience and the wedding kit. I&#039;ve actually changed my mind and am instead planning a wedding in Cancun for April 2012 instead. You sound like a very lucky women having traveled to such wonderful places. Best wishes to you for your wedding. =)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1501106,"PostDate":1312822377,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Stluciabound,<\/p> <p> Thanks so much for offering to help with your experience and the wedding kit. I've actually changed my mind and am instead planning a wedding in Cancun for April 2012 instead. You sound like a very lucky women having traveled to such wonderful places. Best wishes to you for your wedding. =)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mm_cookie@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1308841402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241478.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Honeylime","Id":241478,"Name":"Honeylime","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53458,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57a259b9443dd2583003f88439fd4547","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I was very confused to and very reluctant to call and speak with someone as well! Could you send me the pricing or information that you have? I would love to know-if not no biggy!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1547168,"PostDate":1321414526,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was very confused to and very reluctant to call and speak with someone as well! Could you send me the pricing or information that you have? I would love to know-if not no biggy!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jballucci@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1321414420,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247720.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"2013","Id":247720,"Name":"2013","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53458,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"963997d1159369d8bd393d0c66d97793","RawContent":"Hello! I am hoping that you won&#039;t mind sending me the information as well... I am planning a wedding for Dec 2012 for 18 people including my fiance and I. We&#039;re looking at either Sandals Montego Bay or Negril. I&#039;m getting just pieces of information I need from the website but not much. If you could please email the information at steph_midd@live.com I would greatly appreciate it! Thank you!","Attachments":[],"Id":1569923,"PostDate":1326916657,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello! I am hoping that you won't mind sending me the information as well... I am planning a wedding for Dec 2012 for 18 people including my fiance and I. We're looking at either Sandals Montego Bay or Negril. I'm getting just pieces of information I need from the website but not much. If you could please email the information at steph_midd@live.com I would greatly appreciate it! Thank you!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"steph_midd@live.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1326916096,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250127.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Smidd","Id":250127,"Name":"Smidd","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":53458,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a117e46292c8acd94c160d7741c9b416","RawContent":"Hi, I just read your thread....and I would love a copy of the sandals wedding kit. If you could email that to me, that would be great. Thanks so much. Beth","A