Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Jennifer Davis<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">You should email her. I booked her 2 years ago and I know her prices have gone up a little since then.<br \/> <br \/> Here is a link to the on-line album of my professional pictures:<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/picasaweb.google.com\/davis1974\/WeddingPicturesProfessional?feat=directlink' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Picasa Web Albums - Jennifer - Wedding pictu...<\/a><br \/> <br \/> You just have to click \"slide show\" in the top right corner once the link is opened.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Jen, thanks so much for sharing! Your pics look great, looks like everyone had a BLAST! I am emailing Cecilia right now. <br \/> <br \/> Jess\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10755;116\/st\/20100615\/e\/we+get+hitched%21+\/k\/83f6\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...83f6\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jbrodhead82@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260761580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223894.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jbrodhead82","Id":223894,"Name":"jbrodhead82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8a5f9e65c6ec145b6af7b28b4da7fc0","RawContent":"Jen,\n \n Your pictures are amazing!!! I&#039;m sure you are thrilled how everything turned out! Your hard work planning paid off. By the way, that dance floor is awesome! What restaurant was it in? Was it extra?? I saw one just like that in another resort, but didn&#039;t think EPM had one!","Attachments":[],"Id":980731,"PostDate":1262510140,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Jen,<br \/> <br \/> Your pictures are amazing!!! I'm sure you are thrilled how everything turned out! Your hard work planning paid off. By the way, that dance floor is awesome! What restaurant was it in? Was it extra?? I saw one just like that in another resort, but didn't think EPM had one!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2009\/12\/05\/8Brs.jpg\">http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2009\/12\/05\/8Brs.jpg<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/QoqAm5.png\">http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/QoqAm5.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msg518@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1252365613,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221387.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MSG518","Id":221387,"Name":"MSG518","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3db179cfef603e38c51c114f03cf83fd","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;MSG518&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Jen,\n \n Your pictures are amazing!!! I&#039;m sure you are thrilled how everything turned out! Your hard work planning paid off. By the way, that dance floor is awesome! What restaurant was it in? Was it extra?? I saw one just like that in another resort, but didn&#039;t think EPM had one!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I got the dance floor through the DJ we hired - not from the resort. I used DJ Dorremixx. He was great! The dance floor cost $450 for the night and was worth every penny!\n \n I had my reception in the Spice Terrace which is an open air lounge patio in Spice Restaurant. The space was AMAZING. I highly recommend if you can get it. Yamina advised me that they don&#039;t typically allow DJs in that location because it is close to building 9. However, they let me have it so I&#039;m sure they will let others also. The people in the building 9 rooms facing the terrace didn&#039;t seem to be annoyed. Some of them actually came out and started dancing in the hallway outside their rooms. HAHAHA. It was hysterical!\n \n BTW, I am going to post a pic of Yamina and I (even though I look horrendous as I had just gotten back from scuba diving)! She is so cute and such a doll! Don&#039;t ake the mistake that I did and panic and worry when she didn&#039;t get back to me right away. She is excellent at what she does and will bring everything together for your weddings!\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c336\/dmbstolio\/CancunDecember2009356-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":981088,"PostDate":1262549093,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>MSG518<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Jen,<br \/> <br \/> Your pictures are amazing!!! I'm sure you are thrilled how everything turned out! Your hard work planning paid off. By the way, that dance floor is awesome! What restaurant was it in? Was it extra?? I saw one just like that in another resort, but didn't think EPM had one!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I got the dance floor through the DJ we hired - not from the resort. I used DJ Dorremixx. He was great! The dance floor cost $450 for the night and was worth every penny!<br \/> <br \/> I had my reception in the Spice Terrace which is an open air lounge patio in Spice Restaurant. The space was AMAZING. I highly recommend if you can get it. Yamina advised me that they don't typically allow DJs in that location because it is close to building 9. However, they let me have it so I'm sure they will let others also. The people in the building 9 rooms facing the terrace didn't seem to be annoyed. Some of them actually came out and started dancing in the hallway outside their rooms. HAHAHA. It was hysterical!<br \/> <br \/> BTW, I am going to post a pic of Yamina and I (even though I look horrendous as I had just gotten back from scuba diving)! She is so cute and such a doll! Don't ake the mistake that I did and panic and worry when she didn't get back to me right away. She is excellent at what she does and will bring everything together for your weddings!<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c336\/dmbstolio\/CancunDecember2009356-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c336\/dmbstolio\/Dec122009238-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c3...22009238-1.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jenandken2009.com\">www.jenandken2009.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20091212\/e\/Jen+%26amp%3B+Kenny%27s+wedding\/k\/02c3\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...02c3\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"davis1974@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1215061237,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210302.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":98,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jennifer Davis","Id":210302,"Name":"Jennifer Davis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5ac5be6bfba9f0ad565dcc55024e07a","RawContent":"How were your food choices Jen, the fish sounds amazing. Thanks again for sharing your pictures.","Attachments":[],"Id":981575,"PostDate":1262569388,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                How were your food choices Jen, the fish sounds amazing. Thanks again for sharing your pictures.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20100417\/e\/the+wedding+of+my+dreams\/dt\/-1\/k\/0f53\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...0f53\/event.png<\/a><br><br><i><strong>Excellence Playa Mujeres Bride<br>April 17, 2010<\/strong><\/i><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wukvjpB\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...jpB\/weight.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"s_katrese@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1229629965,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213251.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"s_katrese","Id":213251,"Name":"s_katrese","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95b4fd136532acc7aedf1388145d2093","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;s_katrese&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;How were your food choices Jen, the fish sounds amazing. Thanks again for sharing your pictures.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;The food at the reception was FABULOUS! All of the guests were raving about how good it was!","Attachments":[],"Id":981789,"PostDate":1262579634,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>s_katrese<\/strong> <a href='\/forum\/post\/1122092' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/a>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">How were your food choices Jen, the fish sounds amazing. Thanks again for sharing your pictures.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>The food at the reception was FABULOUS! All of the guests were raving about how good it was!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c336\/dmbstolio\/Dec122009238-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c3...22009238-1.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jenandken2009.com\">www.jenandken2009.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20091212\/e\/Jen+%26amp%3B+Kenny%27s+wedding\/k\/02c3\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...02c3\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"davis1974@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1215061237,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210302.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":98,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jennifer Davis","Id":210302,"Name":"Jennifer Davis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39b9bb78ca73b20b66263f1cd98c952b","RawContent":"Katrese,\n \n I&#039;ve tried 5 times to sit down and figure out this menu! lol I have some really picky eaters that would be turned off by this menu, even though to me it all sounds delicious! What have you decided? I really just want a chicken dish, fish dish, and beef dish to offer my guests. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/doh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Doh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":981851,"PostDate":1262581378,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Katrese,<br \/> <br \/> I've tried 5 times to sit down and figure out this menu! lol I have some really picky eaters that would be turned off by this menu, even though to me it all sounds delicious! What have you decided? I really just want a chicken dish, fish dish, and beef dish to offer my guests. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/doh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Doh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2009\/12\/05\/8Brs.jpg\">http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2009\/12\/05\/8Brs.jpg<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/QoqAm5.png\">http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/QoqAm5.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msg518@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1252365613,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221387.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MSG518","Id":221387,"Name":"MSG518","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"18c7b3df23833978f7dc06a56513b927","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;MSG518&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Katrese,\n \n I&#039;ve tried 5 times to sit down and figure out this menu! lol I have some really picky eaters that would be turned off by this menu, even though to me it all sounds delicious! What have you decided? I really just want a chicken dish, fish dish, and beef dish to offer my guests. &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/doh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Doh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;They&#039;ll give you two choices plus one vegetarian. Not sure if you can get three. That might be pushing it.","Attachments":[],"Id":983114,"PostDate":1262666493,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>MSG518<\/strong> <a href='\/forum\/post\/1122380' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/a>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Katrese,<br \/> <br \/> I've tried 5 times to sit down and figure out this menu! lol I have some really picky eaters that would be turned off by this menu, even though to me it all sounds delicious! What have you decided? I really just want a chicken dish, fish dish, and beef dish to offer my guests. <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/doh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Doh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>They'll give you two choices plus one vegetarian. Not sure if you can get three. That might be pushing it.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c336\/dmbstolio\/Dec122009238-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i30.photobucket.com\/albums\/c3...22009238-1.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jenandken2009.com\">www.jenandken2009.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20091212\/e\/Jen+%26amp%3B+Kenny%27s+wedding\/k\/02c3\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...02c3\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"davis1974@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1215061237,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210302.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":98,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jennifer Davis","Id":210302,"Name":"Jennifer Davis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f55c818f78eb12d37f2617e09289829","RawContent":"Jen Everything Looks just amazing!! I&#039;m sooo happy for you! Love Love Love your dress! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile72.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile72\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":983551,"PostDate":1262687322,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Jen Everything Looks just amazing!! I'm sooo happy for you! Love Love Love your dress! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile72.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile72\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/1768\/20100522\/Until+I+Marry+My+Love\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/...ove\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tracihopeis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238572485,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216339.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"thope","Id":216339,"Name":"thope","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ff68f861a9b321e222d4712c1af67e4a","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;s_katrese&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Yes I have a few guests who have inquired about La Amanda and I posted info about it on our wedding page...I am really trying to encourage everyone to stick with EPM so we can travel as a group. I just feel that if everyone goes to separate hotels and have a crappy time, they will only remember that &amp;quot;my wedding sucked&amp;quot; and lets face it the island doesn&#039;t seem big on partying it seems\/sounds like its remote so I figure if we stick together everyone will have a much better time. I know that&#039;s weird, but I feel like I am responsible for my guests happiness and the overall funess of my wedding, if we split up I just feel like I&#039;ll have even more planning to do to keep us all together.\n \n Hey ladies one question have you had guests ask you why you picked EPM? In my head I&#039;m like because I wanted to. They all make it seem like attendance is mandatory and I feel like if you can&#039;t afford it so be it, but don&#039;t make me feel like I made a mistake by choosing a fairly nice although pricey hotel.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n I hear your Katrese! My reality is getting married in Los Angeles vs. Mexico is far more economical....we are paying for our wedding ourselves &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/shots.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Shots\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; and I didnt want to comprimise on the quality of our wedding &amp;quot;thats why I picked excellence&amp;quot;...sooo that being said I still want our close friends and family to share our special day...i&#039;m not so much concerned about them sharing our entire trip...","Attachments":[],"Id":983556,"PostDate":1262687916,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>s_katrese<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Yes I have a few guests who have inquired about La Amanda and I posted info about it on our wedding page...I am really trying to encourage everyone to stick with EPM so we can travel as a group. I just feel that if everyone goes to separate hotels and have a crappy time, they will only remember that \"my wedding sucked\" and lets face it the island doesn't seem big on partying it seems\/sounds like its remote so I figure if we stick together everyone will have a much better time. I know that's weird, but I feel like I am responsible for my guests happiness and the overall funess of my wedding, if we split up I just feel like I'll have even more planning to do to keep us all together.<br \/> <br \/> Hey ladies one question have you had guests ask you why you picked EPM? In my head I'm like because I wanted to. They all make it seem like attendance is mandatory and I feel like if you can't afford it so be it, but don't make me feel like I made a mistake by choosing a fairly nice although pricey hotel.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> I hear your Katrese! My reality is getting married in Los Angeles vs. Mexico is far more economical....we are paying for our wedding ourselves <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/shots.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Shots\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> and I didnt want to comprimise on the quality of our wedding \"thats why I picked excellence\"...sooo that being said I still want our close friends and family to share our special day...i'm not so much concerned about them sharing our entire trip...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/1768\/20100522\/Until+I+Marry+My+Love\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/...ove\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tracihopeis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238572485,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216339.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"thope","Id":216339,"Name":"thope","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":370,"NextPage":380,"PreviousPage":360,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
