{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"191d98cc2b86c2bd2e3ba497b7960850","RawContent":"I will be having my cocktail hour at X-lounge and I am also getting married at 6.\n \n MSG I have bridesmaids with different bodies so what I did was pick out 5 different dresses at Davids Bridal (I only have 4 bm) so that they could choose what they wanted to wear. My suggestion would be to have them all wear the same material that way they can at least look cohesive. For example maybe they all wear silk gowns or cotton.","Attachments":[],"Id":1001906,"PostDate":1263863450,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I will be having my cocktail hour at X-lounge and I am also getting married at 6.<br \/> <br \/> MSG I have bridesmaids with different bodies so what I did was pick out 5 different dresses at Davids Bridal (I only have 4 bm) so that they could choose what they wanted to wear. My suggestion would be to have them all wear the same material that way they can at least look cohesive. For example maybe they all wear silk gowns or cotton.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20100417\/e\/the+wedding+of+my+dreams\/dt\/-1\/k\/0f53\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...0f53\/event.png<\/a><br><br><i><strong>Excellence Playa Mujeres Bride<br>April 17, 2010<\/strong><\/i><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wukvjpB\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...jpB\/weight.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"s_katrese@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1229629965,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213251.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"s_katrese","Id":213251,"Name":"s_katrese","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97df6b3227663851ed7cb2bdecad6a4e","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Dimenzi&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;At Excellence Riviera Cancun the cocktail hour at the X-Lounge must finish by 6pm so I assume it would be the same at EPM. How long are you having between the end of the ceremony and the start of the cocktail hour?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I&#039;m not sure, I&#039;m thinking we will need an hour for photos...so actually i would like the cocktail hour to start right after the ceremony so my guests will be entertained...What are you doing? Are you taking photos after the ceremony or waiting till next day?","Attachments":[],"Id":1001968,"PostDate":1263866355,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Dimenzi<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">At Excellence Riviera Cancun the cocktail hour at the X-Lounge must finish by 6pm so I assume it would be the same at EPM. How long are you having between the end of the ceremony and the start of the cocktail hour?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I'm not sure, I'm thinking we will need an hour for photos...so actually i would like the cocktail hour to start right after the ceremony so my guests will be entertained...What are you doing? Are you taking photos after the ceremony or waiting till next day?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/1768\/20100522\/Until+I+Marry+My+Love\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/...ove\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tracihopeis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238572485,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216339.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"thope","Id":216339,"Name":"thope","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"51fcc7384b05caea94ff664cf5d23c5a","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;s_katrese&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Butterfly I sent you the information.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thank you sooo much for the information!!!\n \n We just received confirmation of our wedding time too - 2:00pm will be our beach ceremony...and then we&#039;ll follow that with the coctail hour at the X-Lounge!\n \n Talk to you all soon,\n Rebecca","Attachments":[],"Id":1002496,"PostDate":1263889708,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>s_katrese<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Butterfly I sent you the information.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thank you sooo much for the information!!!<br \/> <br \/> We just received confirmation of our wedding time too - 2:00pm will be our beach ceremony...and then we'll follow that with the coctail hour at the X-Lounge!<br \/> <br \/> Talk to you all soon,<br \/> Rebecca\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;95\/st\/20101203\/e\/Our+Dream+Wedding\/k\/adc5\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...adc5\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rebecca.ooyen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260949542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223947.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":78,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ButterflyR12","Id":223947,"Name":"ButterflyR12","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"067b1cf24acd0be26823e493b3073c2f","RawContent":"Hey what projects are you working on... I am trying to send out invites by the end of next week. I know I know its really sad that I am just now getting them in the mail, but I sent out STD in October and I already have an idea who will be attending and who will not. \n \n I also keep debating on where I would like to marry on the beach or in the gazebo. Anyone else confused&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1005173,"PostDate":1264066067,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey what projects are you working on... I am trying to send out invites by the end of next week. I know I know its really sad that I am just now getting them in the mail, but I sent out STD in October and I already have an idea who will be attending and who will not. <br \/> <br \/> I also keep debating on where I would like to marry on the beach or in the gazebo. Anyone else confused<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20100417\/e\/the+wedding+of+my+dreams\/dt\/-1\/k\/0f53\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...0f53\/event.png<\/a><br><br><i><strong>Excellence Playa Mujeres Bride<br>April 17, 2010<\/strong><\/i><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wukvjpB\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...jpB\/weight.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"s_katrese@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1229629965,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213251.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"s_katrese","Id":213251,"Name":"s_katrese","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"062aa96fb13e3fc2a0e7426658895846","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;s_katrese&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hey what projects are you working on... I am trying to send out invites by the end of next week. I know I know its really sad that I am just now getting them in the mail, but I sent out STD in October and I already have an idea who will be attending and who will not. \n \n I also keep debating on where I would like to marry on the beach or in the gazebo. Anyone else confused&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I felt the same way, but I think a big factor is many guests you have. I&#039;m not sure exactly how many people the gazebo can hold, but it looks pretty small. It&#039;s gorgeous, however I also LOVE the idea of getting married on the beach and walking barefoot. So beach wedding for me!","Attachments":[],"Id":1005310,"PostDate":1264096162,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>s_katrese<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hey what projects are you working on... I am trying to send out invites by the end of next week. I know I know its really sad that I am just now getting them in the mail, but I sent out STD in October and I already have an idea who will be attending and who will not. <br \/> <br \/> I also keep debating on where I would like to marry on the beach or in the gazebo. Anyone else confused<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I felt the same way, but I think a big factor is many guests you have. I'm not sure exactly how many people the gazebo can hold, but it looks pretty small. It's gorgeous, however I also LOVE the idea of getting married on the beach and walking barefoot. So beach wedding for me!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2009\/12\/05\/8Brs.jpg\">http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2009\/12\/05\/8Brs.jpg<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/QoqAm5.png\">http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/QoqAm5.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msg518@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1252365613,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221387.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MSG518","Id":221387,"Name":"MSG518","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de99a8b3eaab8388ff364f6a841ee5d9","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;thope&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I&#039;m not sure, I&#039;m thinking we will need an hour for photos...so actually i would like the cocktail hour to start right after the ceremony so my guests will be entertained...What are you doing? Are you taking photos after the ceremony or waiting till next day?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;thope,\n \n I was just reading about this on another thread! I read what a few other girls had to say and my FI and I have decided to take pictures before the ceremony. I never thought I would want to do it that way, but it makes the most sense to us. For a few reasons:\n \n 1.I would love to join my guests during the cocktail hour and I don&#039;t want to have to pull people away from it either.\n \n 2. With the sunset wedding most likely it wouldn&#039;t be bright enough for pictures.\n \n 3. I want to capture my FI and my reaction to eachother in an intimate setting. \n \n 4. Also all nerves are out the window when it comes time for the ceremony.","Attachments":[],"Id":1005317,"PostDate":1264096777,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>thope<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I'm not sure, I'm thinking we will need an hour for photos...so actually i would like the cocktail hour to start right after the ceremony so my guests will be entertained...What are you doing? Are you taking photos after the ceremony or waiting till next day?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>thope,<br \/> <br \/> I was just reading about this on another thread! I read what a few other girls had to say and my FI and I have decided to take pictures before the ceremony. I never thought I would want to do it that way, but it makes the most sense to us. For a few reasons:<br \/> <br \/> 1.I would love to join my guests during the cocktail hour and I don't want to have to pull people away from it either.<br \/> <br \/> 2. With the sunset wedding most likely it wouldn't be bright enough for pictures.<br \/> <br \/> 3. I want to capture my FI and my reaction to eachother in an intimate setting. <br \/> <br \/> 4. Also all nerves are out the window when it comes time for the ceremony.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2009\/12\/05\/8Brs.jpg\">http:\/\/daisypath.com\/pic\/2009\/12\/05\/8Brs.jpg<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/QoqAm5.png\">http:\/\/dvcf.daisypath.com\/QoqAm5.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msg518@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1252365613,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221387.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MSG518","Id":221387,"Name":"MSG518","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7852457186399bbfce78001ac716764","RawContent":"Hello, Im planning my wedding at this resort as well. Originally I wanted to have my wedding at the Secrets Maroma but the date I wanted its already taken. Anyway, I have not been to EPM but I read a lot of reviews and I think its going to be good. I just wanted to know how was your experience when planning your wedding with them, any suggestions? Thanks.","Attachments":[],"Id":1006093,"PostDate":1264124721,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello, Im planning my wedding at this resort as well. Originally I wanted to have my wedding at the Secrets Maroma but the date I wanted its already taken. Anyway, I have not been to EPM but I read a lot of reviews and I think its going to be good. I just wanted to know how was your experience when planning your wedding with them, any suggestions? Thanks.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erikagall00@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1263909104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224848.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ocean bride","Id":224848,"Name":"ocean bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6d7188fbbb228c2711f44a9344cfb4a","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;MSG518&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;thope,\n \n I was just reading about this on another thread! I read what a few other girls had to say and my FI and I have decided to take pictures before the ceremony. I never thought I would want to do it that way, but it makes the most sense to us. For a few reasons:\n \n 1.I would love to join my guests during the cocktail hour and I don&#039;t want to have to pull people away from it either.\n \n 2. With the sunset wedding most likely it wouldn&#039;t be bright enough for pictures.\n \n 3. I want to capture my FI and my reaction to eachother in an intimate setting. \n \n 4. Also all nerves are out the window when it comes time for the ceremony.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thanks for that...I hadnt thought of taking pics b4 the wedding....great idea!!\n Katrese I&#039;m going w the gazebo...i love my shoes and i think they will sink in the sand...my next project is wedding programs...\n I finally hired a photog...i&#039;m using Citalli Rico from Claudia Rodriquez....great shots and good pricing...so excited.","Attachments":[],"Id":1006330,"PostDate":1264134258,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>MSG518<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">thope,<br \/> <br \/> I was just reading about this on another thread! I read what a few other girls had to say and my FI and I have decided to take pictures before the ceremony. I never thought I would want to do it that way, but it makes the most sense to us. For a few reasons:<br \/> <br \/> 1.I would love to join my guests during the cocktail hour and I don't want to have to pull people away from it either.<br \/> <br \/> 2. With the sunset wedding most likely it wouldn't be bright enough for pictures.<br \/> <br \/> 3. I want to capture my FI and my reaction to eachother in an intimate setting. <br \/> <br \/> 4. Also all nerves are out the window when it comes time for the ceremony.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thanks for that...I hadnt thought of taking pics b4 the wedding....great idea!!<br \/> Katrese I'm going w the gazebo...i love my shoes and i think they will sink in the sand...my next project is wedding programs...<br \/> I finally hired a photog...i'm using Citalli Rico from Claudia Rodriquez....great shots and good pricing...so excited.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/1768\/20100522\/Until+I+Marry+My+Love\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1159\/...ove\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tracihopeis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1238572485,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216339.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"thope","Id":216339,"Name":"thope","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9db435ef53a3285e28929e8470df855e","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;s_katrese&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hey what projects are you working on... I am trying to send out invites by the end of next week. I know I know its really sad that I am just now getting them in the mail, but I sent out STD in October and I already have an idea who will be attending and who will not. \n \n I also keep debating on where I would like to marry on the beach or in the gazebo. Anyone else confused&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I like the idea of the gazebo (I think the max is 42 people) but the beach would be fun too. I like that it is off to the side of the resort so that there aren&#039;t people walking around during your ceremony.","Attachments":[],"Id":1008535,"PostDate":1264329222,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>s_katrese<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hey what projects are you working on... I am trying to send out invites by the end of next week. I know I know its really sad that I am just now getting them in the mail, but I sent out STD in October and I already have an idea who will be attending and who will not. <br \/> <br \/> I also keep debating on where I would like to marry on the beach or in the gazebo. Anyone else confused<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I like the idea of the gazebo (I think the max is 42 people) but the beach would be fun too. I like that it is off to the side of the resort so that there aren't people walking around during your ceremony.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"caroline0277@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1240535780,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216996.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"caroline0277","Id":216996,"Name":"caroline0277","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27268,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e35cc240fe06ef119241b64464a564c3","RawContent":"So I know I have asked this question before... but have any of you been to EPM and other resorts in Cancun for a basis of comparison. I thought EPM was beautiful when we were there but I am wondering how it compares to other Cancun resorts. Any thoughts?","Attachments":[],"Id":1008596,"PostDate":1264359671,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So I know I have asked this question before... but have any of you been to EPM and other resorts in Cancun for a basis of comparison. I thought EPM was beautiful when we were there but I am wondering how it compares to other Cancun resorts. Any thoughts?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"caroline0277@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1240535780,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216996.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"caroline0277","Id":216996,"Name":"caroline0277","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2874,"TotalPages":288,"CurrentPage":410,"NextPage":420,"PreviousPage":400,"LastPage":2870},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
