{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":491,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1858195,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":278813,"Name":"Mandy78987","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1404459947,"LastPoster":{"Id":279443,"Name":"xxalex18","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":32,"Preview":{"Id":1866663,"PostDate":1408109041,"PostContent":"I have been to Bali but have not stayed in either of these! They are amazing and if I am ever bac...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alexandraksymons@bigpond.com","IpAddress":"124.190.86.168","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1408099091,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"xxalex18","Id":279443,"Name":"xxalex18","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"101.127.224.29","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77470,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f2ac523976e0ae839756ca4c3379167a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(20,20,20);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:14.399999618530273px;background-color:rgb(252,252,255);\"&gt;Hi everyone!&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(20,20,20);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:14.399999618530273px;background-color:rgb(252,252,255);\"&gt;My fiancee and I are thinking of having our honeymoon in Bali next year. I&#039;ve always wanted to stay in one of the villas located along the beach, or in the middle of the rice fields (either in Canggu, or in the Peninsula \/ South of Bali)&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(20,20,20);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:14.399999618530273px;background-color:rgb(252,252,255);\"&gt;I came across this article about the top three honeymoon villas in Bali (&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.wedding-bali.com\/2014\/06\/top-3-villas-perfect-for-a-honeymoon\"&gt;http:\/\/www.wedding-bali.com\/2014\/06\/top-3-villas-perfect-for-a-honeymoon&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(20,20,20);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:14.399999618530273px;background-color:rgb(252,252,255);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14.545454025268555px;background-color:rgb(252,252,255);\"&gt;Out of the three villas mentioned, Villa bulung daya is my favourite. (The view of the rice fields is amazing).&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(20,20,20);font-family:Georgia, &#039;Times New Roman&#039;, Times, serif;font-size:14.399999618530273px;background-color:rgb(252,252,255);\"&gt;Has anyone stayed in these villas before? The pictures look amazing, and the information of the villas sound great but I would love to hear about your comments or experiences at these villas!\n\n\n(or if you have other honeymoon villas to recommend, drop me a message!)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858195,"PostDate":1404459947,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(20,20,20);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:14.399999618530273px;background-color:rgb(252,252,255);\">Hi everyone!<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(20,20,20);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:14.399999618530273px;background-color:rgb(252,252,255);\">My fiancee and I are thinking of having our honeymoon in Bali next year. I've always wanted to stay in one of the villas located along the beach, or in the middle of the rice fields (either in Canggu, or in the Peninsula \/ South of Bali)<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(20,20,20);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:14.399999618530273px;background-color:rgb(252,252,255);\">I came across this article about the top three honeymoon villas in Bali (<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.wedding-bali.com\/2014\/06\/top-3-villas-perfect-for-a-honeymoon' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.wedding-b...for-a-honeymoon<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(20,20,20);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:14.399999618530273px;background-color:rgb(252,252,255);\">\u00a0)<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14.545454025268555px;background-color:rgb(252,252,255)\">Out of the three villas mentioned, Villa bulung daya is my favourite. (The view of the rice fields is amazing).\u00a0<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(20,20,20);font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:14.399999618530273px;background-color:rgb(252,252,255);\">Has anyone stayed in these villas before? The pictures look amazing, and the information of the villas sound great but I would love to hear about your comments or experiences at these villas!<br><br>\n(or if you have other honeymoon villas to recommend, drop me a message!)<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mandy78987@gmail.com","IpAddress":"101.127.224.29","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404380463,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Mandy78987","Id":278813,"Name":"Mandy78987","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.153.132.106","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77470,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c2a16782350d8f11e6b16996177994d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Omg I am not getting married but damn! Those villas look GORGEOUS!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You just made me want to go to Bali. I definitely agree with you, Villa Bulung Daya is stunning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858254,"PostDate":1404504836,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Omg I am not getting married but damn! Those villas look GORGEOUS!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You just made me want to go to Bali. I definitely agree with you, Villa Bulung Daya is stunning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<strong class='bbc'><em class='bbc'><span style='color: #696969'>iWedding Mexico <\/span><\/em><\/strong><span style='color: #696969'>takes the stress out of wedding planning! Always available and ready to help you achieve your dream wedding in paradise!<\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong class='bbc'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><span style='color: #000000'>iWedding Mexico, Playa del Carmen<\/span><\/span><\/strong><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 12px;'>daniela@iweddingmexico.com<\/span><br \/>\n<strong class='bbc'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.iweddingmexico.com'>http:\/\/www.iweddingmexico.com<\/a><\/span><\/strong><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong class='bbc'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>xoxoxo<\/span><\/strong>","Email":"daniela@iweddingmexico.com","IpAddress":"187.153.148.127","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1397240595,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277556.png?_r=1402077292","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":157,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"iWeddingMexico","Id":277556,"Name":"iWeddingMexico","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"101.127.224.29","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77470,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95a00692bdccd3cd2fd045b74be74ef3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Yes, Bali is Lovely.&amp;nbsp;\n\n\nRecently we&#039;ve been thinking of having a destination wedding there too ; p At the moment, we&#039;re still do a search up on costs.&amp;nbsp;\n\n\nDoes anyone have any advice\/ recommendations on wedding venues or wedding providers in Bali?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858915,"PostDate":1404985298,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Yes, Bali is Lovely.\u00a0<br><br>\nRecently we've been thinking of having a destination wedding there too ; p At the moment, we're still do a search up on costs.\u00a0<br><br>\nDoes anyone have any advice\/ recommendations on wedding venues or wedding providers in Bali?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mandy78987@gmail.com","IpAddress":"101.127.224.29","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404380463,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Mandy78987","Id":278813,"Name":"Mandy78987","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"124.190.86.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77470,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4d250cba94018fc38bde5adc1a6337d3","RawContent":"I have been to Bali but have not stayed in either of these! They are amazing and if I am ever back in Bali I know two new options :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1866663,"PostDate":1408109041,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have been to Bali but have not stayed in either of these! They are amazing and if I am ever back in Bali I know two new options <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alexandraksymons@bigpond.com","IpAddress":"124.190.86.168","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1408099091,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"xxalex18","Id":279443,"Name":"xxalex18","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77470","Title":"Looking For Tips For Honeymoon In Bali!","LastPostDate":1408109041},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
